<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">RRK06.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YOSHUA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Yoshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yos</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOSHUA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutoorana Yoshua okuhungurira Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Bwanyima y'okufa kwa Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA, MUKAMA akagambira Yoshua mwene Nuuni, omuheereza wa Musa, ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:5">Bir 34:5</ref>. </char></note> Musa omugaragwa wangye afiire; n'ahabw'ekyo imuka, oyambukye omugyera ogu Yorudani, iwe n'eihanga eri ryona, mutaahe omu nsi ei ndikuha Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Omwanya gwona ogu muriribatamu, ngubahaire, nk'oku naagambiire Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:31">Kur 23:31</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aha ihamba n'orushozi oru Lebanooni, okuhika aha mugyera omuhango Furaati, ensi yoona ey'Abahiiti, okuhika aha Nyanja empango ey'oburengyerwa-izooba, egyo niyo eriba emyatano yaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:11">Zab 46:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 8:37">37</ref>. </char></note> Tihaine muntu weena oribaasa kukuza omu kaso ebiro byona eby'amagara gaawe; nk'oku naabaire ndi na Musa, nikwo ndiguma naiwe; tindikuhemukaho, kandi tindikutsigaho. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Ba ow'amaani, ogume omutima; ahakuba niiwe orihunguza eihanga eri ensi ei naarahiire kuha baishenkurubo. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:23">Kub 27:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:15">Yos 11:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ba ow'amaani, ogumire kimwe omutima, kandi oyerinde ohitsye ebiragiro byona ebi Musa omugaragwa wangye yaakuragiire; otaribiteishukaho kutoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, obone kubaasikirwa, ei oriza yoona. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:2">Zab 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:2">Enf 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Ekitabo eki eky'ebiragiro kitarikuruga omu kanwa; kureka ogume nookiteekateekaho nyomushana na nyekiro, obone kwerinda, ohitsye byona ebihandiikirwemu; obwo nibwo oriheebwa omugisha ei oriza yoona, okabaasa gye byona. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:1">Zab 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:8">Yer 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Tiinye naakuragiira? Ba ow'amaani, ogume omutima; otatiina, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryaguma naiwe, ei oriza yoona.<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okugambira abantu eby'okwambuka Yorudani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Ahonaaho Yoshua yaaragiira abatware b'abantu ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:2">Yos 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Mugyende nimuraba omu rusiisira rwona, muragiire abantu muti: Mwekomere entanda, ahakuba omu biro bishatu nimwija kwambuka ogu mugyera Yorudani, kuza kukubuura ensi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuba eyaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Kandi Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, Yoshua yaabagira ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:20">Kub 32:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:2-4">Yos 22:2-4</ref>. </char></note> Mwijukye ekigambo eki Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabaragiire naagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahaire oburuhuukiro, kandi aryabaha ensi egi. <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Abakazi baanyu n'abaana baanyu n'amatungo gaanyu biryaguma omu nsi ei Musa yaabahaire seenu ya Yorudani; kwonka imwe mwena amamanzi nimwija kwambuka, mwebembeire beene waanyu, mwine eby'okurwanisa, mubahwere, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />okuhitsya obu MUKAMA ariha beene waanyu oburuhuukiro, nk'oku naimwe yaabubahaire, nabo bakakubuura ensi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha. Bwanyima imwe muryagaruka omu nsi ei mwakubwire, mugirye, niyo nsi ei Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabahaire seenu ya Yorudani aha bukiizi bw'oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Baagarukamu Yoshua nibagira bati: Ebi waaturagiira byona turyabikora, kandi yoona ei oritutuma turyazayo. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Kut 21:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku twayorobeire Musa omuri byona, naiwe nikwo turikworobera; kwonka MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe agume naiwe, nk'oku yaabaire ari na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Omuntu weena origomera ebiragiro byawe, akanga kuhurira ebigambo byona ebi orikumuragiira, aryaitwa. Kwonka ba ow'amaani, ogume omutima.<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rahabu okushereka entatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:25">Yak 2:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire bari omuri Shitimu, Yoshua mwene Nuuni yaatuma abantu babiri omu mubonano kuza kutata, naagira ati: Mwirooko mwetegyereze ensi, muno-muno Yeriko. Baagyenda, baahikira omu nju ya maraaya orikwetwa Rahabu, baaraaramu. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 127:1">Zab 127:1</ref>. </char></note> Haabaho owaagambira omugabe wa Yeriko, naagira ati: Twahurira ngu abashaija babiri b'Abaisraeli baija kunu eki kiro kutata ensi. <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Omugabe wa Yeriko yaatuma ahari Rahabu, ati: Shohoza abantu abaizire owaawe, bakataaha omu nju yaawe; ahakuba baizire kutata ensi yoona. <verse eid="JOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:19">2 Sam 17:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ogwo mukazi akaba yaatwaire abo bashaija babiri, yaabasherekire-mbwenu yaagira ati: N'eky'amazima, haine abashaija baizire owangye; kwonka timmanyire ei babaire nibaruga; <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />ku bwizire, bari haihi kukinga eirembo, abo bashaija baashohora; tindikumanya i batoire; murahukye kubakurata, nimwija kubakwata. <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Kwonka we akashangwa yaabatembize aha mutwe gw'enju, abasherekireyo, abashwekire furakisi ei yaabaire ayanikireyo. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Abashaija b'omugabe nikwo kugyenda nibabasherura omu muhanda ogurikuza Yorudani okuhika aha nyambukiro; ahonaaho abarikubasherura ku baabaire baarugaho, eirembo ryakingwa.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Endagaano ya Rahabu n'entatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Ku baabaire batakabyamire, Rahabu yaatemba, yaabashanga aha mutwe gw'enju; <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:25">Bir 2:25</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Nimmanya ku Mukama abahaire egi nsi, tugizire obwoba bwingi ahabwanyu, kandi n'abatuuzi boona ab'omu nsi egi nibahwerera omu maisho gaanyu; <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:24">Kub 21:24</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:34">34</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:35">35</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba tukahurira oku MUKAMA yaayomize amaizi g'Enyanja erikutukura omu maisho gaanyu, obu mwaruga Misri, kandi n'oku mwagizire abagabe b'Abaamori bombi, abaabaire bari seeri ya Yorudani, Sihooni na Ogi, abu mwacwekyerereize kimwe. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:1">Yos 5:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:34">Dan 4:34</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:23">Zek 8:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho ku twakihuriire, emitima yaatuhwa omunda, kandi tihaine muntu weena owaatsigairwe omutima omunda ahabwanyu; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe Ruhanga ow'ahaiguru omu iguru, kandi ow'ahansi omu nsi. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:14-17">1 Sam 20:14-17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nimbeeshengyereza, nk'oku mbagiriire eby'embabazi, mundahire MUKAMA, naimwe ku murizigirira enju ya tata, haza mumpe akamanyiso kahamire, <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />kandi ku murirokora tata na maawe, banyaanyazi n'abarumuna bangye n'ebi baine byona, mukakiza amagara gaitu. <verse eid="JOS 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:24">Bar 1:24</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija baamugarukamu bati: Nk'oku mukirize amagara gaitu, turyakiza agaanyu; ku muraabe mutatwatiire naama, turyabagirira embabazi omu mazima, MUKAMA ku arituha ensi egi.<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Entatsi okugarukayo n'okugambira Yoshua amakuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:25">Byak 9:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaabashuumya n'omurunga naabarabya omu dirisa; ahakuba enju ye ekaba eyombekirwe aha mutwe gw'orugo rw'amabaare orw'orurembo, kandi niho yaabaire atuura. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Yaabagira ati: Muhungire omu bibungo, abarikubasherura batakaababugana; mumareyo ebiro bishatu mwesherekire, okuhitsya abarikubasherura obu baraagarukye; bwanyima mubone kwegyendera. <verse eid="JOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Abashaija baamugarukamu bati: Tituriturwa egi ndahiro ei waaturahiza. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:12">Kut 19:12</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ku turiba twaizire omu nsi egi, oryakoma aka kagoye akarikutukura omu dirisa ei waaturabyamu, oteeranire omu nju yaawe sho na nyoko na banyaanyoko n'ab'omu ka ya sho boona. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:26">Kub 35:26</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 35:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena oriba yaarugire omu nju, akaza omu nguuto, eshagama ye niwe eritukurira, kwonka itwe teritubaho; kandi ou oriba oine omu nju, yaagira ekyamubaho, eshagama ye niitwe eritukurira. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Kwonka ku oritwatira enaama, titurigira rubanja rw'endahiro ei waaturahiza. <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Yaagira ati: Kibe nk'oku mwagamba. Atyo yaaboohereza, baagyenda; yaakoma akagoye karikutukura omu dirisa. <verse eid="JOS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Baagyenda baaza omu bibungo, baamarayo kashatu, okuhitsya obu abaabaire nibabasherura baagarukireyo; ahabw'okuba bakabasherura omu muhanda gwona, baababurira. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Bwanyima ezo entatsi zombi zaaruga omu bibungo, zaashuuma, zaayambuka; ku zaahikire ahari Yoshua mwene Nuuni, zaamuteekyerereza byona ebyazibaireho. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:2">Yos 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:27">Kur 23:27</ref>. </char></note> Zaagira Yoshua ziti: N'eky'amazima, MUKAMA atuhaire ensi egi yoona, kandi n'abatuuzi baamwo boona nibahwerera omu maisho gaitu.<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okuragiira Abaisraeli eby'okwambuka Yorudani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:1">Yos 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe; we n'Abaisraeli boona baaruga Shitimu, baahika Yorudani, baaraarayo batakambukire. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu abatware baagyenda baaraba omu rusiisira, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:33">Kub 10:33</ref>. </char></note> nibaragiira abantu bati: Ku muraareebe eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu eyekoreirwe abanyamurwa Abaleevi, ahonaaho murugye ahu muri, mugikuratire, <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />mubone kumanya omuhanda ogu muraatoore, ahakuba timukagurabamuga. Kwonka mutsigye ahagati yaanyu nayo omwanya gwa mikono nk'enkumi ibiri; mutagiirira haihi. <verse eid="JOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:7">Lev 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:18">Kub 11:18</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:13">Yos 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:16">Yoel 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaagambira abantu ati: Mweyeze, ahabw'okuba nyencakare MUKAMA naija kukorera omuriimwe eby'okutangaaza. <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Kandi Yoshua yaagambira abanyamurwa ati: Muheekye eshanduukye y'endagaano, mwambukye mwebembeire abantu. Baaheeka eshanduukye y'endagaano, baayebembera abantu.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 4:14">Yos 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:25">1 Bus 29:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Eri izooba niinyija kutandika kukuha ekitiinisa omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona, bamanye ngu nk'oku naabaire ndi na Musa, nikwo ndikwija kuba naiwe. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Noija kuragiira abanyamurwa abaheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano oti: Ku muraahikye aha nkungu y'amaizi ga Yorudani, muragaremu, mwemerere. <verse eid="JOS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yoshua yaagambira Abaisraeli ati: Muhikye aha, muhurire ebigambo bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 1:9">1 Tes 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 33:2">Kur 33:2</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaagira ati: Eki nikyo muraamanyireho ku Ruhanga otahwaho ari omuriimwe kandi ku atariremwa kubinga Abanyakanaani omu maisho ganyu, Abahiiti, Abahiivi, Abaperizi, Abagirugashi, Abaamori n'Abayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Zab 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:13">Mik 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ow'ensi yoona neija kubabandiza kuza omuri Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Mbwenu mutoorane abantu ikumi na babiri omu nganda za Israeli, omuri buri ruganda mwihemu omuntu omwe. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:8">Kur 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 114:3">Zab 114:3</ref>. </char></note> Ebigyere by'abanyamurwa abaheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, Mukama ow'ensi yoona, ku biraahikye omu maizi ga Yorudani, amaizi ago agarikushuuma nigaruga eruguru nigaija kuzibirwa kugyenda, geemerere geerunzire hamwe.<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwambuka Yorudani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Batyo abantu baaruga omu mahema gaabo kwambuka Yorudani, beebembeirwe abanyamurwa abaheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano; <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:15">1 Bus 12:15</ref>. </char></note> ababaire bagiheekire, ku baahikire ahari Yorudani, baahitsya ebigyere byabo omu maizi, (omu igyesha amaizi ga Yorudani gaijura, garengyera aha nkungu zaayo zoona) <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />amaizi agaabaire nigashuuma, nigaruga eruguru, gaayemerera, gaayerunda hamwe hare munonga aha rurembo orurikwetwa Adamu aha rubaju rwa Zaretaani, n'agaabaire nigashuuma omu nyanja ya Araba, niyo Nyanja y'omwonyo, gaahweraho kimwe; abantu baayambuka bagyemire Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:29">Kur 14:29</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa, abaabaire baheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano eya MUKAMA, baayemerera ahoomire batarikuterera ahagati ya Yorudani; n'Abaisraeli boona baayambukira ahoomire, okuhitsya obu eihanga ryona ryaherize kwambuka Yorudani.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Amabaare g'ekiijutsyo ikumi n'abiri agaihirwe omuri Yorudani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:2">Bir 27:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihanga ryona ku ryaherize kwambuka Yorudani, MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:31">1 Bag 18:31</ref>. </char></note> Iha abantu ikumi na babiri omu ihanga ryona, omuri buri ruganda oihemu omwe, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />obaragiire oti: Mutorotoore amabaare ikumi n'abiri ahagati ya Yorudani, ahi ebigyere by'abanyamurwa byemereire, mugambukane, mugate ahu muraaraare eki kiro. <verse eid="JOS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Yoshua yaayeta abo bantu abu yaatooraine omu Baisraeli, omuntu omwe omuri buri ruganda; <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />yaabagira ati: Mwirooko mwebembere eshanduukye ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu okuhika ahagati ya Yorudani, buri muntu weena omuriimwe nk'oku enganda za Israeli zirikwingana, atorotoore eibaare, arite aha ibega, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:26">Kur 12:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:14">13:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:20">Bir 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:3-6">Zab 78:3-6</ref>. </char></note> ako kabe akamanyiso omuriimwe, abaana baanyu ku baribabuuza omu biro ebiriija bati: Amabaare aga nigamanyisa ki? <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Naimwe muryabagira ngu amaizi ga Yorudani gakacuubwamu habiri omu maisho g'eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA; obu yaayambuka Yorudani, amaizi gaayo gakacuubwamu habiri. Kandi amabaare aga garyaba ekiijutsyo ky'ebiro byona aha Baisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Abaisraeli baakora nk'oku Yoshua yaabaragiira, baatorotoora amabaare ikumi n'abiri ahagati ya Yorudani agarikwingana n'omubaro gw'enganda z'Abaisraeli, nk'oku MUKAMA agambiire Yoshua; baagambukana, baahika omu mwanya ahu baaraire, baagata aho. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Kandi Yoshua nawe yaabyara amabaare ikumi n'abiri ahagati ya Yorudani ahi ebigyere by'abanyamurwa abaabaire baheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano byayemereire; gakibaho n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwambukira kimwe n'okugomberera Gilugaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Abanyamurwa abaabaire baheekire eshanduukye baayemerera ahagati ya Yorudani, okuhitsya obu byona ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire Yoshua kumanyisa abantu byahweireyo, nk'ebi Musa yaaragiire Yoshua byona oku byabaire biri; abantu baayambuka nibeehuuta. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Abantu boona ku baaherize kwambuka, eshanduukye ya MUKAMA nayo yaayambuka hamwe n'abanyamurwa, abantu nibabareeba. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:20">Kub 32:20</ref>. </char></note> Aba Reubeeni n'aba Gaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase nabo baayambuka bakwaitse eby'okurwanisa, beebembeire Abaisraeli, nk'oku Musa yaabagambiire; <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />bari nk'obukumi buna beeteekateekyeire orugamba, baayambuka omu maisho ga MUKAMA kurwanira omu mpita za Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 3:7">Yos 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba eryo MUKAMA yaaha Yoshua ekitiinisa omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona; baaguma nibamutiina ebiro byona eby'amagara ge, nk'oku baabaire batiina Musa.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />Ragiira abanyamurwa abaheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano, bainamukye barugye omuri Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Yoshua nikwo kuragiira abanyamurwa ati: Mwinamukye murugye omuri Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Kandi abanyamurwa abaabaire baheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ku baarugire omuri Yorudani, ebigyere byabo byahika aha nkungu, amaizi ga Yorudani gaagaruka omu mwanya gwago, gaarengyera aha nkungu zaayo zoona, nk'oku gaabaire gari.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Abantu baaruga omuri Yorudani aha kiro kya ikumi ky'okwezi kw'okubanza, baasiisira Gilugaali aha mwatano gwa Yeriko ogw'oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Kandi amabaare gari ikumi n'abiri agu baihire omuri Yorudani, Yoshua yaagabyara Gilugaali. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Bwanyima yaagambira Abaisraeli ati: Abaana baanyu ku baribuuza baishebo omu biro ebiriija bati: Amabaare aga nigamanyisa ki? <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Obwo muryabashobororera muti: Abaisraeli bakambuka Yorudani egi eyomire. <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:11">Neh 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu akoomya amaizi ga Yorudani omu maisho gaanyu, okuhitsya obu mwayambukire, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaagizire Enyanja erikutukura, ei yaayomize omu maisho gaitu, okuhitsya obu twayambukire; <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:46">1 Sam 17:46</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:26-29">Dan 3:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:16">Kur 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:6-8">Zab 76:6-8</ref>. </char></note> ngu amahanga goona ag'ensi gabone kumanya omukono gwa MUKAMA ku guri ogw'amaani; kandi naimwe mubone kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebiro byona.<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okushara abantu, n'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:14">Kur 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:5">1 Bag 10:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagabe b'Abaamori boona, abaabaire bari seeri ya Yorudani orubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, n'abagabe b'Abanyakanaani boona, abaabaire batwire aha rubaju rw'enyanja, ku baahuriire ngu MUKAMA ayomize amaizi ga Yorudani omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, okuhitsya obu bambukire, emitima yaabahwa omunda, kandi tibaatsigarwamu mwoyo gwona ahabw'eihanga ry'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Omu bunaku obwo MUKAMA akagambira Yoshua ati: Mwebaijere emisyo omu mabaare, oshare Abaisraeli obwa kabiri. <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Yoshua yaabaija emisyo omu mabaare, yaasharira Abaisraeli aha mugongo Aralooti. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Kub 14:29</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:64">26:64</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekyareeteire Yoshua okubashara n'eki; abashaija boona abaarugire Misri bakaba baherize kugwa omu muhanda ogurikuraba omu ihamba, barimu abarwani boona abaarugire Misri. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Abantu boona abaarugire Misri bakaba bashazirwe; kwonka boona abu baazaariire omu ihamba bakiri omu muhanda baarugire Misri, bo bakaba batakashazirwe. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:10">Zab 95:10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:11">Heb 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abaisraeli bakamara emyaka makumi ana nibazengyerera omu ihamba, okuhitsya obu abashaija abarwani b'eihanga ryabo ryona baafiire bakahwaho ahabw'okutahurira iraka rya MUKAMA; kandi MUKAMA akaba yaabarahiire ku ataribaikiriza kureeba ensi ei yaaraganiise baishenkurubo kutuha, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo abaana baabo abu MUKAMA yaagarwire omu mwanya gwabo, nibo Yoshua yaashazire; bakaba batashazirwe, ahabw'okuba tibarashazirwe bakiri omu muhanda. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:25">Kut 34:25</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija boona, ku baaherize kusharwa, baaguma omu myanya yaabo omu rusiisira, okuhitsya obu baakizire. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:3">Lev 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Eri izooba naabaihaho ekijumo eky'Abanyamisri. N'ahabw'ekyo omwanya ogwo gukeetwa Gilugaali n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kur 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:5">Kub 9:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli ku baabaire bakiri Gilugaali, baagira obugyenyi bw'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho aha kiro ky'okwezi ekya ikumi na bina omu mwabazyo omu mpita za Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Omu kasheeshe akaakuratiire Okuhingurwaho aha izooba eryo baarya aha by'okurya by'egyo nsi, emigaati etatumbisiibwe n'ebicoori bikarangire. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Ku baaherize kurya eby'okurya by'egyo nsi, omu kasheeshe akandi emaanu tiyaaboneka; kandi Abaisraeli tibaagaruka kugitunga, kureka baaguma nibarya eby'okurya by'ensi ya Kanaani ogwo mwaka.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okubugaabugana na maraika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:23">Kur 23:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua ku yaabaire ari haihi na Yeriko, yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba omushaija amwemereire omu maisho, aine rurara esyoirweyo omu mukono gwe. Yoshua yaamuhikaho, yaamubuuza ati: Ori ow'orubaju rwaitu, nari orw'abazigu? <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Kush 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:3">Kut 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugarukamu ati: Ngaaha! Kureka naija kuba omukuru w'eihe rya MUKAMA. Yoshua yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara, yaamuramya, yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, nooragiira ki omwiru waawe? <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Kur 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:25">1 Bus 16:25</ref>. </char></note> Omukuru w'eihe rya MUKAMA yaagira Yoshua ati: Iha enkaito omu bigyere byawe; ahakuba omwanya ogu oyemereiremu n'ogurikwera. Yoshua yaakora atyo.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugambira Yoshua oku araahwerekyereze Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Yeriko ekaba ekingiirwe kimwe ahabw'okutiina Abaisraeli; tihaine waabaire naashohora n'obu kwakuba okutaaha. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:18">Dan 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:19">19</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Reeba, nkuhaire Yeriko n'omugabe waayo n'abashaija baayo amamanzi g'amaani. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Imwe mwena, abashaija abarwani, nimwija kweziguurutsya orurembo omurundi gumwe; mukore mutyo amazooba mukaaga. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:16">Bar 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 10:8">Kub 10:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamurwa mushanju nibaija kutwara enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama, beebembere eshanduukye y'endagaano; aha izooba rya mushanju muziguurukye orurembo emirundi mushanju, obwo abanyamurwa nibateera enzamba. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Ku baraateere enzamba y'akasirikiriro n'eihembe ry'empaya y'entaama, naimwe mwahurira eiraka ryayo, abantu boona bateerere hamwe orwari; ahonaaho orugo rw'amabaare rw'orurembo nirwija kukumbagara, rugwe ahansi, buri muntu arutembere ahu araabe yaahika. <verse eid="JOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Bwanyima Yoshua mwene Nuuni yaayeta abanyamurwa, yaabagira ati: Muheekye eshanduukye y'endagaano, kandi n'abanyamurwa mushanju batware enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama beebembere eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Kandi yaagambira abantu ati: Mwimukye, muziguurukye orurembo, abaine eby'okurwanisa barabeho beebembere eshanduukye ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Yoshua ku yaaherize kugambira abantu, abanyamurwa mushanju abaabaire baine enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama omu maisho ga Mukama baagyenda omu maisho, nibateera enzamba, eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ebakuratiire. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Abashaija abaabaire baine eby'okurwanisa baayebembera abanyamurwa abaabaire nibateera enzamba; ab'enyima baakuratira eshanduukye, obwo enzamba zigumiizemu nizigamba. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Yoshua yaaragiira abantu ati: Mutateera orwari, n'amaraka gaanyu gatahurirwa, kandi hatagira owaateeza, okuhitsya aha izooba eri ndaabaragiirireho kuteera orwari; obwo nibwo muraaruteere. <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Atyo yaaziguurutsya eshanduukye ya MUKAMA orurembo omurundi gumwe; baagaruka omu rusiisira, baaraaramu.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaaguruka kare omu kasheeshe, abanyamurwa baaheeka eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:26">1 Bus 15:26</ref>. </char></note> N'abanyamurwa mushanju, abaabaire baine enzamba mushanju z'amahembe g'empaya z'entaama beebembeire eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, baarabaho, baagumizamu nibateera enzamba; n'abashaija abaabaire baine eby'okurwanisa baabeebembera, ab'enyima baakuratira eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, obwo enzamba nizigamba. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />N'aha izooba rya kabiri baaziguuruka orurembo omurundi gumwe; baagaruka omu rusiisira rwabo. Baamara ebiro mukaaga nibakora batyo.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Aha izooba rya mushanju baimuka kare omushekye nigujuguta, baaziguuruka orurembo, nk'oku baabaire nibagira; kwonka aha izooba eryo baaruziguuruka emirundi mushanju. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:20">Bar 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:14">2 Bus 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Aha murundi gwa mushanju, abanyamurwa ku baateire enzamba, Yoshua yaagambira abantu ati: Muteere orwari! Ahakuba orurembo MUKAMA yaarubaha. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:4">Yos 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:6">1 Sam 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:41">Mat 10:41</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orurembo n'ebirimu byona nibiija kubiikirwa MUKAMA, kureka Rahabu maraaya na boona abaraashangwe omu nju ye nibo baraakire, ahabw'okuba akashereka entumwa ezi twatumire. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:26">Bir 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:17">13:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:1">Yos 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:17">2 Kor 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:22">1 Tes 5:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe mwerindire kimwe ekintu kyona ekibiikiirwe MUKAMA; ku muraabe mwabibiikire, hatakaagira owaatwara kimwe aharibyo, akareetera orusiisira rw'Abaisraeli kuhwerekyerera n'okwitwa kubi. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Kwonka efeeza yoona n'ezaabu, ebintu eby'emiringa n'ebyoma n'ebirikwera ebitooraniirwe MUKAMA; bize omu ibiikiro rye.<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:30">Heb 11:30</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 11:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho abantu baateera orwari, n'enzamba zaateerwa. Abantu ku baahuriire eiraka ry'enzamba, baateera munonga orwari, orugo rwakumbagara, rwagwa ahansi, batyo abantu baarutemberaho, baataaha omu rurembo, omuntu weena ahu yaabaire yaahika, baarukwata. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16">Bir 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:3">1 Sam 15:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:18">18</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Baacwekyerereza kimwe ekintu kyona ekyabaire kirimu, abashaija n'abakazi, abato n'abakuru, ente n'entaama n'endogoya, baabiitsa rurara.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaagira abashaija bari ababiri abaatatsire ensi, ati: Mutaahe omu nju ya maraaya, mwihemu ogwo mukazi n'abe boona, nk'oku mwamuraganiise. <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:13">Yos 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abo batsigazi abaatatsire baataahamu, baihamu Rahabu, na ishe, na nyina, na banyaanya n'ebye byona; kandi baihamu n'abu aine nabo obuzaare, baabata aheeru y'orusiisira rw'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Bwanyima baayotsya orurembo n'ebyabaire birimu byona; kwonka efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebintu by'emiringa n'ebyoma baabita omu ibiikiro ery'omu nju ya Mukama. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:5">Mat 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Rahabu maraaya, n'enju ya ishe n'abe boona Yoshua yaabarokora; Rahabu ogwo yaatuura omuri Israeli n'okuhitsya eri izooba, ahakuba akashereka entumwa ezi Yoshua yaatumire kutata Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okukyeena Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:34">1 Bag 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:4">Mal 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Yoshua yaabeehanangiriza naarahira ati: Omuntu weena oriimuka, akagaruka kwombeka orurembo oru Yeriko, akyeenwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Omu bunaku obu ariba naayombekyeramu omusingi, omwana we w'omujigaijo aryafa; kandi ku ariba naabyara ebiti by'amarembo gaarwo, omwana wa bucuranda aryafa.<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:2">Kut 39:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:8">Bir 31:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:9">2 Sam 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 9:3">Yos 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaagumire na Yoshua, n'okurangaanwa kwe kukabuga ensi yoona.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okuteera Ai, n'okubingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 22:20">Yos 22:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Abaisraeli baacumura omu byabiikiirwe MUKAMA; ahakuba Akani, mwene Karumi, mwijukuru wa Zabudi, mwene Zeera, ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda, akatwara aha bibiikirwe; MUKAMA yaagirira Abaisraeli ekiniga, kyayaka nk'omuriro. <verse eid="JOS 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yoshua yaatuma abantu ari Yeriko kuza Ai haihi na Besaveeni, aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Beseeli, naabagira ati: Mwinamukye mutate egyo nsi. Abashaija abo baagyenda baatata Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Bwanyima baagaruka ahari Yoshua, baamugira bati: Abantu boona batazayo, kureka hagyende abantu nk'enkumi ibiri nari ishatu, babe nibo baateera Ai, otaruhiza busha abantu boona, ahabw'okuba abantu baayo ni bakye. <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:17">Isa 30:17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hainamukayo abantu nk'enkumi ishatu; ku baahikireyo, aba Ai baababinga. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:36">Lev 26:36</ref>. </char></note> Baabaitamu abantu nka makumi ashatu na mukaaga; baabaiha omu maisho g'amarembo gaabo, bababingire baabahitsya Shebariimu, baabaitira aha kashuumo. N'ahabw'ekyo emitima y'abantu yaayaga, yaaba nk'amaizi.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okutakira Mukama, n'okumubuuza ekyababingisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:5">Kub 14:5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 14:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:3-5">Ezr 9:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:12">1 Sam 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua ku yaakihuriire, yaataagura eby'okujwara bye, yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara omu maisho g'eshanduukye ya MUKAMA okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, we n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli; baayeshuka eiju omu mutwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:22">Kur 5:22</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua nikwo kugira ati: Ai bambe, MUKAMA Ruhanga! Aba bantu okabambukiza ki Yorudani okutuhayo omu mikono y'Abaamori kutuhwerekyereza? Haakiri kuri twagumire seeri ya Yorudani! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Ai MUKAMA, mbwenu ngambe ki, obu Abaisraeli baateire abazigu baabo amabega! <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:4">Zab 83:4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:13">Kub 14:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abanyakanaani n'abatwire omu nsi egi nibaija kukihurira, batukubire ahagati, bamare eiziina ryaitu omu nsi. Mbwenu oryakora ki ahabw'eiziina ryawe erikuru?<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Imuka! N'enki ekikujuumaize ahansi? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Abaisraeli bacumwire, baita endagaano yangye, ei naabahaire; baatwara aha bibiikirwe, baiba, kandi baaryarya, baabita omu bintu byabo. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:45">Kub 14:45</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:14">Bar 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Abaisraeli batarikubaasiza kusyamirana n'abazigu baabo; nibabahunga ahabw'okuba bahindukire abakyeenirwe. Kandi tindiguma naimwe bundi, kureka biri mwahwerekyereza ebibiikiirwe MUKAMA ebiri omuriimwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:5">Yos 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Imuka, oyeze abantu, kandi obagire oti; Mweyeze ahabw'eizooba rya nyencakare; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli naagira ati: Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, omuriimwe harimu ebibiikiirwe MUKAMA; timurikubaasa kusyamirana n'abazigu baanyu, okuhitsya obu muraihe omuriimwe ebibiikirwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:19-21">1 Sam 10:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:33">Enf 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:24-26">Byak 1:24-26</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omu kasheeshe nimwija kureetwa haihi omu nganda zaanyu; kandi oruganda oru MUKAMA araatoorane nirwija kwija nk'emiryango yaarwo oku eri; kandi omuryango ogu MUKAMA araatoorane nigwija kwija nk'amaju gaagwo oku gari; kandi enju ei MUKAMA araatoorane hagume nihaija omuntu omwe-omwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:7">Kut 34:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oraakwatwe aine ebintu ebibiikirwe naija kwokibwa n'ebi aine byona; ahakuba aitsire endagaano ya MUKAMA, yaakora ekirikuhemura omu Baisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akani okukwatwa n'okwitwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Yoshua yaaguruka kare omu kasheeshe, yaateeranira hamwe Abaisraeli omu nganda zaabo; oruganda rwa Yuda rwatooranwa; <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />yairiza haihi emiryango ya Yuda, haatooranwamu omuryango gwa Zeera; yairiza haihi ab'enju ya Zeera omwe-omwe, Zabudi yaatooranwa; <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:23">Kub 32:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:1-10">Byak 5:1-10</ref>. </char></note> yairiza haihi ab'enju ya Zabudi omwe-omwe, haatooranwa Akani mwene Karumi, mwijukuru wa Zabudi, mwene Zeera ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:6">Kub 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 5:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaagira Akani ati: Mwana wangye, ninkweshengyereza, heereza MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli ekitiinisa, omwaturire; kandi ongambire hati mbwenu eki okozire, otakinshereka. <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani yaagarukamu Yoshua, naagira ati: N'eky'amazima ncumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, kandi eki nikyo nkozire. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:20-27">2 Bag 5:20-27</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:27">Enf 15:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:15">Luk 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Tim 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndeebire omu minyago ekijwaro kirungi kya Shinaari na shekeli magana abiri z'efeeza kandi n'omuhimba gw'ezaabu ogwine oburemeezi bwa shekeli makumi ataano, naabyetenga, naabitwara; na mbwenu bisherekire omu itaka, biri omu ihema ryangye ahagati, n'efeeza eri ahansi yaabyo.<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Yoshua nikwo kutuma entumwa, zikairuka, zikataaha omu ihema, zikashanga bisherekire omu ihema rye n'efeeza eri ahansi yaabyo; <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />bakabiihamu bakabireetera Yoshua n'Abaisraeli boona, bakabita ahansi omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Yoshua n'Abaisraeli boona baatwara Akani mutabani wa Zeera n'efeeza n'ekijwaro n'omuhimba gw'ezaabu n'abatabani na bahara be n'ente ze n'endogoya ze n'entaama ze n'eihema rye n'ebi yaabaire aine byona, baabishuumya omu ruhanga rwa Akori. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:17">1 Bag 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:7">1 Bus 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikireyo, Yoshua yaamubuuza ati: Otwitiire ki kubi? Naiwe MUKAMA yaaza kukwita kubi eri izooba. Abaisraeli boona baamuteera amabaare; ku baaherize kubateera amabaare, baabootsya n'omuriro. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:17">2 Sam 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:17">Bir 13:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:10">Isa 65:10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:15">Hos 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baamurundaho omutuumo muhango gw'amabaare, ogukiriho n'eri izooba. Okuruga obwo MUKAMA yaayegarukamu, yaareka ekiniga kye kingi. Na mbwenu omwanya ogwo nigukyetwa Oruhanga rwa Akori n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okuteera Ai n'okwita omugabe waayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:3">Zab 44:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Otatiina, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima; twara abarwani boona, oimukye oinamukye oteere Ai; reeba, ntaire omugabe waayo n'abantu be n'orurembo rwe n'ensi ye omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:21">Yos 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 20:14">Bir 20:14</ref>. </char></note> Noija kugira Ai n'omugabe waayo nk'oku waagizire Yeriko n'omugabe waayo; kwonka eminyago yaayo n'ente zaayo mubyetwarire, bibe eminyago yaanyu; mugwere enyima y'orurembo.<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Yoshua nikwo kwimuka n'engabo ze zoona kuza kuteera Ai; akatoorana abashaija b'amaani amamanzi obukumi bushatu, akaboohereza nyekiro; <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:29">Bar 20:29</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 20:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:13">2 Bus 13:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akabaragiira ati: Reeba, nimwija kugwera enyima y'orurembo; mutaruza hare munonga, kureka mugume mweteekateekire; <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />nyowe n'abantu abu nyine nitwija kwirira haihi n'orurembo; ku baraije kuturwanisa nk'okubanza, nitwija kubahunga; <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />nabo nibaija kwija batubingire, okuhitsya obu turaababeihabeihe tukabaiha omu rurembo; ahakuba nibaija kugira bati: Baatuhunga nk'okubanza; itwe nitwija kugumizamu kubahunga; <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />haza imwe abaaba babagwereire mwimukye mukwate orurembo; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu naija kuruhayo omu mikono yaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Ku muraaheze kurukwata, murutwekyemu omuriro; mutwaze nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaragiire; ekyo nikyo naabaragiira. <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Yoshua yaaboohereza, baaza ahu barikuza kugwera, baaraara ahagati ya Beseeli na Ai aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba bwa Ai; kwonka ekyo kiro Yoshua we yaaraara n'abatsigaireyo. <verse eid="JOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe, yaateerana abantu, yainamuka n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli, beebembeire abantu nibaza Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Abantu boona abarwani abu yaabaire aine bainamuka, baahika haihi omu maisho g'orurembo, baasiisira aha rubaju rwa bumosho orwa Ai; aho hakaba hariho oruhanga ahagati yaabo na Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Bwanyima yaatwara abantu nk'enkumi itaano, yaabaragiira kugwera ahagati ya Beseeli na Ai aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba bw'orurembo. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Okwo nikwo baatengire orugamba; eihe ry'amaani bakarita aha rubaju rwa bumosho rw'orurembo, n'abandi ab'okugwera, baabata aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba; kwonka Yoshua ekyo kiro yaakiraara omu ruhanga. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Omugabe wa Ai ku yaakireebire, we n'abantu be boona ab'omu rurembo baimuka kare n'obwira, baaza kurwanisa Abaisraeli aharikushuuma omu ruhita; kwonka tiyaamanya ku hariho abagwereire enyima y'orurembo. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:36">Bar 20:36</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua n'Abaisraeli boona baayehindura nk'abaabingwa omu maisho gaabo, baahunga nibatoora omu ihamba. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:3">Kur 14:3</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 20:31">Bar 20:31</ref>. </char></note> N'abantu boona abaabaire bari omu rurembo baayetwa kuteeranira hamwe kubakurata; ku baayeyongyeire kubinga Yoshua, baayeyongyera kuza hare n'orurembo. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Tihaagira mushaija weena owaatsigara omuri Ai nari omuri Beseeli, otarashohoire kubinga Abaisraeli; baatsiga orurembo rurangaire, baakurata Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Imutsya eicumu ryawe eri okwaitse, oryorekye Ai; ahakuba naaza kugihayo omu mikono yaawe. Yoshua yaimutsya eicumu eri yaabaire akwaitse, yaaryoreka Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Ku yaagoroire omukono gwe, abaabaire bagwereire ahonaaho baimuka ahu baabaire bari, bairuka, baataaha omu rurembo; baarukwata, baarahuka baarutwekamu omuriro. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Aba Ai ku baanagire amaisho enyima, baareeba omwika nigutuumuuka ahaiguru, baabura agahungira oku nari kuriya, ahakuba abaabaire bahungiire omu ihamba bakahindukana abaabaire bababingire. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yoshua n'ab'Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire abaabaire bagwereire baakwata orurembo, kandi baareeba n'omwika gw'omu rurembo nigutuumuuka ahaiguru, baagaruka, baita abantu ba Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:5">Yob 20:5</ref>. </char></note> N'abaakwatsire orurembo baashohora kubarwanisa; aba Ai nikwo kukubirwa ahagati y'Abaisraeli, bakabareetwa oku n'oku, bakabaita, hakabura owaahonoka aha icumu, n'obu kwakuba okuhunga. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Omugabe wa Ai we baamukwata ahuriire, baamureetera Yoshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Abaisraeli ku baaherize kwitira kimwe aba Ai boona omu bwerere omu irungu, ei baabaire babakuratiire, n'abandi boona baabaita na rurara, okuhitsya obu baabamariireho kimwe, baagaruka Ai, baagihwerekyereza na rurara. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Abantu boona aba Ai, abaafiire eryo izooba, abashaija n'abakazi, bakaba bari kakumi n'enkumi ibiri; <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />ahakuba Yoshua taragwisize mukono gwe, ogwabaire gwimukize eicumu, okuhitsya obu yaaherize kucwekyerereza kimwe aba Ai boona. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Kureka ente n'eminyago eby'omuri orwo rurembo Abaisraeli bakabyetwarira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambiire Yoshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:16">Bir 13:16</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaayotsya Ai, yaagihindura amatongo agatarituurwamu ebiro byona, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:26">Yos 10:26</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 10:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Bir 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Yaahanika omugabe wa Ai aha muti okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; kandi eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, Yoshua yaaragiira, baahanura omutumbi gwe, baagunaga omu maisho g'eirembo ry'orurembo, baagurundaho omutuumo muhango gw'amabaare, ogukiriho n'okuhitsya eri izooba.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okwombeka eitambiro n'okurihandiikaho ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 8:20">Kut 8:20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:7">12:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yoshua yaayombekyera MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli eitambiro aha kabungo Ebali, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:24">Kur 20:24</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:25">25</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku Musa omugaragwa wa Mukama yaaragiire Abaisraeli, kandi nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo eky'ebiragiro bya Musa, okuryombekyesa amabaare gatabaizire, agu omuntu weena atakatahoga kyoma; baaritambiriraho MUKAMA ebitambo ebyokize, baahayo empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:2">Bir 27:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 27:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aho niho yaahandiikiire ahari ago mabaare omu maisho g'Abaisraeli ebiragiro ebi Musa yaahandiikire. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:11-13">1 Bus 15:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:29">Bir 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli boona, enzaarwa n'abanyamahanga, n'abakuru baabo n'abategyeki n'abaramuzi, baayemerera embaju zombi z'eshanduukye ya MUKAMA omu maisho g'abanyamurwa b'Abaleevi, abaabaire baheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA; ekicweka kimwe kyayemerera omu maisho g'akabungo Gerizimu, kandi ekindi kyayemerera omu maisho g'akabungo Ebali; nk'oku Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaaragiire okubanza, kushabira Abaisraeli omugisha. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:3">Neh 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:19">Bir 30:19</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaashoma ebigambo by'ebiragiro byona, eby'omugisha n'eby'emikyeeno, nk'oku byona byabaire bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:12">Bir 31:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:38">Kur 12:38</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho kigambo na kimwe ahari byona ebi Musa yaaragiire, eki Yoshua atarashomeire mu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona, obwo harimu abakazi n'abaana n'abanyamahanga abaabaire nibagyenda nabo.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abandi bagabe okukwatanisa kurwanisa Abaisraeli, n'aba Gibeoni okwecwera obwengye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Kut 15:18-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagabe boona, owa Hiiti, owa Amori, owa Kanaani, owa Perizi, owa Hiivi n'owa Yebusi, abaabaire batwire seeri ya Yorudani, ab'omu nsi y'ebibungo n'omu mpita n'ab'aha rubaju rwona orw'Enyanja empango orurikureeba Lebanooni, ku baahuriire ebyo, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Zab 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:3">83:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 83:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:9-12">Isa 8:9-12</ref>. </char></note> baayeteerana n'omutima gumwe kurwanisa Yoshua n'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 10:2">Yos 10:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka aba Gibeoni ku baahuriire oku Yoshua yaagizire Yeriko na Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />baacwa obwengye, baayehindura entumwa, baakoma entanda, baatwara ebiguniya aha ndogoya zaabo n'efurebe za viinyo ezikuzire eziteire ebiremu, <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />baajwara enkaito zikuzire, ezibambatikire ebiremu, n'emyenda y'obucancabari; kandi entanda zaabo zoona ez'emigaati zikaba zoomire kandi zihumbire. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Baimuka, baashanga Yoshua n'Abaisraeli omu rusiisira Gilugaali, baabagira bati: Nituruga omu nsi ya hare; n'ahabw'ekyo muturaganise endagaano. <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:2">Bir 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:2">Bar 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baagarukamu Abahiivi bati: Obundi mukaaba mutwire naitwe; mbwenu obwo nitubaasa tuta kukora naimwe endagaano? <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Baagira Yoshua bati: Turi abairu baawe. Yoshua yaababuuza ati: Muri baahi? Kandi nimuruga hi? <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:10">Yos 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Itwe abairu baawe nituruga omu nsi ya hare; ekitureetsire aha n'eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ahakuba tukahurira okurangaanwa kwe n'ebi yaakozire omuri Misri byona, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />kandi n'oku yaagizire abagabe b'Abaamori bombi aba seeri ya Yorudani, Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni, na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani, owaabaire atwire Ashitaroosi. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Mbwenu abakuru baitu n'abantu b'owaitu boona bakatugira ngu, Mutware entanda ahabw'orugyendo, mugyende mubabugane, mubagire muti: Turi abairu baanyu; mbwenu muturaganise endagaano. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Kandi entanda zaitu ezi tukazikomera omu maka gaitu nizikyotsya, aha izooba eri twaimukiireho nitwija kubareeba; mbwenu reeba, zaayomire, kandi zaahumbire. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Kandi efurebe ezi tukaziijuza viinyo zikirinsya; mbwenu reeba, zifumagurukire. Ebijwaro n'enkaito bitukuriireho ahabw'orugyendo ruraingwa munonga. <verse eid="JOS 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 23:10">1 Sam 23:10</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 23:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:1">Isa 30:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baikiriza ahabw'okureeba eby'okurya byabo, batabuurize MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:2">2 Sam 21:2</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaaragaana nabo endagaano y'obusingye, ku ataribaita; n'abakuru b'eihanga baabarahira.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro bishatu baherize kuragaana nabo, baahurira ku bari bataahi baabo, kandi ku batwire nabo. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Abaisraeli baagyenda, baahika aha ndembo zaabo aha kiro kya kashatu. Endembo zaabo zikaba ziri Gibeoni, Kefira, Beeroosi na Kiryasi-yearimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 15:4">Zab 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaisraeli tibaabaita, ahakuba abakuru b'eihanga bakabarahira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. Eihanga ryona ryayetomboitera abakuru. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Kwonka abakuru boona baagambira eihanga ryona bati: Tubarahiire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo titurikubaasa kubakoraho. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:13-18">Ezk 17:13-18</ref>. </char></note> Eki turaakore nikwo kubareka bahuriire, tutakaahikwaho ekiniga ahabw'okwita endahiro ei tubarahiire. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Kandi abakuru baabagira bati: Mubarekye bagumeho. Bwanyima baahinduka abasheenyi b'enku n'abatahi b'amaizi b'eihanga ryona, nk'oku abakuru baabagambiire. <verse eid="JOS 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Kandi Yoshua yaabeeta, yaabagira ati: Mutubeiheire ki, nimugira muti: Tubari hare munonga; haza kunu mutwire naitwe? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo mbwenu mwakyeenwa; kandi abamwe omuriimwe baryaba abahuuku b'okusheenya enku n'okutaha amaizi ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga wangye. <verse eid="JOS 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:51-56">Kub 33:51-56</ref>. </char></note> Baagarukamu Yoshua bati: Manya itwe abairu baawe tukagambirirwa kimwe ku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaaragiire Musa omugaragwa we kubaha ensi yoona n'okuhwerekyereza abagitwiremu boona, bakahweraho kimwe omu maisho gaanyu; nikyo twabatiiniire munonga ngu tutafa, tukakora tutyo. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Mbwenu nu, reeba turi omu mikono yaawe; otukore kyona eki orikureeba ngu ni kirungi kandi kihikire omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Nikwo yaabagizire atyo; akabakiza omu mikono y'Abaisraeli, tibaabaita. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:29">1 Bag 8:29</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga obwo Yoshua yaabahindura abasheenyi b'enku n'abatahi b'amaizi b'eihanga n'eitambiro rya MUKAMA omu mwanya gwona ogu yaabaire atoorana n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Okurwanisa abagabe bataano n'okubabinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 9:15">Yos 9:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Adoni-zedeki omugabe wa Yerusaalemu, ku yaahuriire ngu Yoshua akwatsire Ai yaagihwerekyerereza kimwe; kandi ngu nk'oku yaagizire Yeriko n'omugabe waayo, nikwo agizire Ai n'omugabe waayo; kandi n'oku aba Gibeoni baaragaine n'Abaisraeli eby'okuguma nabo n'obusingye, bakatuura nabo, <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:14-16">Kur 15:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:4-6">Zab 48:4-6</ref>. </char></note> yaatiina munonga, ahakuba Gibeoni rukaba ruri orurembo rw'amaani nk'endembo z'abagabe ezindi oku zaabaire ziri, nangwa rukaba nirukira na Ai, n'abashaija baayo bari amamanzi. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Nikyo kyareeteire Adoni-zedeki omugabe wa Yerusaalemu kutuma ahari Hohamu omugabe wa Heburooni na Piramu omugabe wa Yaramuusi na Yafia omugabe wa Lakishi, na Debira omugabe wa Egulooni, naagira ati: <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />Mwinamukye, mumpe emikono, tuteere Gibeoni; ahakuba eragaine na Yoshua n'Abaisraeli eby'obusingye. <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo abagabe bataano b'aba Amori, omugabe wa Yerusaalemu, omugabe wa Heburooni, omugabe wa Yaramuusi, omugabe wa Lakishi, n'omugabe wa Egulooni, baayeteeranira hamwe n'amahe gaabo goona, bainamuka, baasiisira ahari Gibeoni, baagirwanisa.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Aba Gibeoni baatuma ahari Yoshua omu rusiisira Gilugaali nibagira bati: Otahinya omukono gwawe kureka abairu baawe; rahuka otuhe emikono, otuhwere; ahakuba abagabe boona b'Abaamori abatwire omu nsi y'ebibungo beeteeraine kuturwanisa. <verse eid="JOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Atyo Yoshua yainamuka naaruga Gilugaali, we n'engabo ze zoona, kandi n'abashaija boona ab'amaani amamanzi. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:25">Bir 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yos 1:5</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Yoshua ati: Otabatiina, ahakuba mbahaireyo omu mikono yaawe; kandi tihariho mushaija weena aharibo oraasyamirane naiwe. <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Ahonaaho Yoshua yaabagwaho, ahabw'okuba akaija ekiro kyona, naaruga Gilugaali. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:21">Isa 28:21</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaabahahaaza emitima omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, baabaitamu abantu baingi munonga omuri Gibeoni, abandi baababinga nibabatooza ogurikwinamuka Besi-horoni, baagyenda nibabaita okuhika Azeka na Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:13">Zab 18:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 18:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:30">Isa 30:30</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibahunga Abaisraeli nibashuuma kuruga Besi-horoni, MUKAMA yaabateeza emengo z'orubaare niziruga omu iguru, baagyenda nibafa okuhitsya obu baahikire Azeka; abaitsirwe orubaare baakira abu Abaisraeli baitsize rurara.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eizooba okutarenga ahabw'okushaba kwa Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Aha izooba eri MUKAMA yaahereireyo Abaamori omu mikono y'Abaisraeli, Yoshua akagambirira MUKAMA omu maisho gaabo, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">Iwe izooba 'we, yemerera ahaiguru ya Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">Naiwe kwezi 'we, yemerera ahaiguru y'oruhanga rwa Ayalooni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 3:11">Hab 3:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Eizooba ryayemerera, n'okwezi kwaguma aho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:13">Okuhitsya obu eryo ihanga ryaherize kuhoora abazigu baaryo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Timurikumanya ekyo ku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Yashari? Eizooba ryayemerera ahagati y'eiguru, tiryarahuka kurenga, ryamara omwanya nk'ogw'eizooba ryona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:18">2 Sam 1:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 38:8">Isa 38:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:26-29">Bir 33:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:10">Yos 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:20">Neh 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho izooba erirabaire nk'eryo omu gaaribandiize n'agaakuratsireho, obu MUKAMA yaahurira eiraka ry'omuntu; ahakuba MUKAMA akarwanirira Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaatabaaruka n'Abaisraeli boona, baagaruka omu rusiisira Gilugaali.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwitwa kw'abagabe bataano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Abagabe bari abataano baahunga, baayeshereka omu nyanga eyaabaire eri Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Yoshua yaagambirwa ku abo bagabe bataano baashangirwe beesherekire omu nyanga ya Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yoshua yaaragiira ati: Mukumbagaze amabaare mahango, mugate aha munwa gw'enyanga, muteho n'abashaija b'okubarinda; <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />kwonka mutasiibayo; kureka mukurate abazigu baanyu, mutandikire aha b'enyima, mubaite mutabaikiriza kutaaha omu ndembo zaabo; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahaireyo omu mikono yaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Yoshua n'Abaisraeli ku baaherize kwitira kimwe baingi munonga omuribo, abaatsigaireho baahungira omu ndembo eziine engo zigumire, <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 11:7">Kur 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:17">Isa 54:17</ref>. </char></note> abantu boona baagaruka n'obusingye ahari Yoshua omu rusiisira Makeda; kandi tihaagira n'omwe owaagaruka kwimutsya orurimi kujuma Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaaragiira ati: Mwigure enyanga, mushohoze abo bagabe bataano, mubandeetere. <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Baakora batyo, baiha abo bagabe bataano omu nyanga, baabamureetera, omugabe wa Yerusaalemu, owa Heburooni, owa Yaramuusi, owa Lakishi, n'owa Egulooni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-12">Zab 2:8-12</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kushohoza abo bagabe, baabamureetera, Yoshua yaayeta Abaisraeli boona, yaagambira abakuru b'engabo abaahurwire nawe, ati: Mwirire haihi, muribate aba bagabe aha bitsya. Bairira haihi, baabaribata aha bitsya. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:10">2 Kor 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:19">Bir 7:19</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaabagambira ati: Mutatiina, kandi mutahahaaza emitima; mube ab'amaani, mugume emitima; ahabw'okuba nikwo MUKAMA arigira ati abazigu baanyu boona abu murirwanisa. <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:29">Yos 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 21:6">2 Sam 21:6</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 21:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 149:7">Zab 149:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 149:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yoshua yaabacumita, yaabaita, yaabahanika aha miti etaano; baaguma aha miti okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, Yoshua yaaragiira, baabahanura aha miti, baabanaga omu nyanga omu baabaire beesherekire, baarunda amabaare mahango aha munwa gwayo, n'okuhitsya eri izooba gakibaho.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okukubuura endembo zaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Eryo izooba Yoshua yaakwata Makeda; abantu baayo n'omugabe waayo yaabaitsa rurara; yaabacwekyerereza kimwe; tiyaatsigaho n'omwe ahari boona abaabaire barutwiremu. Kandi yaagira omugabe wa Makeda nk'oku yaagizire owa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:22">2 Bag 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:8">19:8</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua n'Abaisraeli boona baaruga Makeda, baateera Libuna, baagirwanisa; <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />nayo MUKAMA yaagihayo omu mikono y'Abaisraeli n'omugabe waayo; baabaitsa rurara, tibaatsigaho n'omwe ahari boona abaabaire barutwiremu. Yoshua yaagira omugabe waayo nk'oku yaagizire owa Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaaruga Libuna n'Abaisraeli boona, baahurura Lakishi, baateerayo orusiisira kugirwanisa. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />MUKAMA yaahayo Lakishi omu mikono y'Abaisraeli, baagikwata aha kiro kya kabiri, baagihwerekyereza na rurara, baita abantu boona abaabaire barimu, nk'oku baagizire Libuna omuri byona.<verse eid="JOS 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:29">Bar 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:16">1 Bag 9:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Horamu omugabe wa Gezeri yainamuka kuha aba Lakishi emikono. Yoshua yaamwita n'abantu be boona, okuhitsya obu yaabamazireho.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Yoshua yaaruga Lakishi n'Abaisraeli boona, baahurura Egulooni, baateerayo orusiisira kugirwanisa. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Baagikwata aha izooba eryo, baagihwerekyereza na rurara, n'abantu baamwo boona baabacwekyerereza kimwe eryo izooba, nk'oku yaagizire Lakishi omuri byona.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:1">2 Sam 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 5:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua yaaruga Egulooni n'Abaisraeli boona, baaza Heburooni; baagiteera, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />baagikwata, baagihwerekyereza na rurara, n'omugabe waayo n'endembo zaayo zoona, n'abantu baamwo boona; tiyaatsigaho muntu n'omwe, nk'oku yaagizire Egulooni omuri byona; kureka yaagicwekyerereza kimwe n'abantu baamwo boona.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Yoshua yaagaruka n'Abaisraeli boona, baahurura Debira, baagirwanisa, <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />yaagikwata n'omugabe waayo n'endembo zaayo zoona; baagihwerekyereza na rurara, baacwekyereza abantu baayo boona; tiyaatsigaho n'omwe. Nk'oku yaagizire Heburooni, na Libuna n'omugabe waayo, nikwo yaagizire Debira n'omugabe waayo.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:2">Bir 7:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo Yoshua yaateire ensi egyo yoona, ey'ebibungo na Negebu n'ey'empita n'ey'enkiizi z'emigongo, n'abagabe baayo boona; taratsigireho muntu n'omwe, kureka akacwekyerereza kimwe boona abarikwitsya, nka MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli oku yaaragiire. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:6">Amo 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5">Zek 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:26">Byak 8:26</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaabaita okuruga Kadeshi-barunea okuhika Gaaza, n'ensi yoona eya Gosheni okuhika Gibeoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:4">Isa 43:4</ref>. </char></note> Abo bagabe boona n'ensi yaabo Yoshua akabakwata omu hururu emwe; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli akabarwanirira. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaatabaaruka n'Abaisraeli boona, baagaruka omu rusiisira Gilugaali.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okurwanisa Yabini n'abandi bagabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 4:2">Bar 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Zab 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yabini omugabe wa Hazori ku yaakihuriire, yaatuma ahari Yobabu omugabe wa Madoni, n'owa Shimirooni, n'owa Akisaafu, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />n'aha bagabe abaabaire batwire aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho omu nsi y'ebibungo n'omuri Araba aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo obwa Kineroosi, omu mpita n'omu bibungo bya Doori aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />n'ah'Abanyakanaani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba n'oburengyerwa-izooba, n'ah'Abaamori n'Abahiiti n'Abaperizi n'Abayebusi omu nsi y'ebibungo, n'ah'Abahiivi ahansi ya Herumooni omu nsi ya Mizipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Baahurura n'amahe gaabo goona, engabo nyingi munonga ezirikwingana n'omusheenyi ogw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja, baine embaraasi n'ebigaari bingi munonga. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Abo bagabe boona baayeteerana, baija baasiisira hamwe aha nyanja ya Meromu kurwanisa Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: Otabatiina, ahakuba boona niinyija kubahayo omu mikono y'Abaisraeli kubaita; embaraasi zaabo muziteme ebiteega, n'ebigaari byabo mubyotsye n'omuriro. <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Yoshua nikwo kwija n'engabo ze zoona, bakabagwaho aha nyanja ya Meromu batakimanyire; <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />MUKAMA akabahayo omu mikono y'Abaisraeli, bakabaita, bakababinga, bakabahitsya Sidoni empango na Miserofoosi-maimu n'omu ruhanga rwa Mizipe aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba; bakabaita, batatsigyeho n'omwe. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Kandi Yoshua yaabagira nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire; yaatema ebiteega by'embaraasi zaabo, n'ebigaari byabo yaabyotsya.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Omu biro ebyo Yoshua yaakubuuka, yaakwata Hazori, yaitsa omugabe waayo rurara; ahakuba obunyakare Hazori ekaba eri omutwe gw'obugabe obwo bwona. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Abaisraeli baitsa rurara boona abaabaire barimu, baabacwekyerereza kimwe; tihaatsigaraho n'omwe orikwitsya; n'orurembo Hazori baarwotsya. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Kandi endembo zoona ez'abo bagabe Yoshua yaazikwata, n'abagabe baazo boona yaabaitsa rurara, yaabacwekyerereza kimwe, nka Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA oku yaaragiire. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Kwonka Abaisraeli tibarookize rurembo na rumwe ahari ezo ezaayombekirwe aha mituumo y'ezindi, kureka Hazori yonka; niyo Yoshua yaayokize. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Kandi eminyago yoona n'amatungo goona ebyarugire omu ndembo ezo Abaisraeli bakabyetwarira; kwonka abantu boona baabaitsa rurara, okuhitsya obu baabahwerekyerereize kimwe, batatsigyeho n'omwe orikwitsya. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:2">Bir 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa omugaragwa we, nikwo Musa yaaragiire Yoshua, na Yoshua nikwo yaatwarize; taine kyona eki yaatsigire kitakozirwe ahari byona ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okukubuura ensi yoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Okwo nikwo Yoshua yaakubwire egyo nsi yoona, ey'enshozi na Negebu yoona, n'ensi ya Gosheni yoona, n'ey'empita na Araba, n'ey'ebibungo bya Israeli n'empita zaayo, <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Bir 7:24</ref>. </char></note> okwiha aha kibungo kya Halaki ekirikwinamuka Seiri, okuhitsya Baali-gaadi omu ruhanga rwa Lebanooni ahansi y'orushozi Herumooni. N'abagabe baayo boona yaabakwata, yaabacumita, yaabaita. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yoshua yaamara omwanya muhango naarwanisa abo bagabe boona. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3">Yos 9:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 9:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho rurembo orwaragaine kugira n'Abaisraeli obusingye, kureka Abahiivi abaabaire batwire Gibeoni; ezindi zoona bakazirwanisa, baazikwata; <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:4">Bar 14:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:25">1 Sam 2:25</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:18">Rom 9:18</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ekyo kikaruga ahari MUKAMA kugangaaza emitima yaabo, bakaza kurwanisa Abaisraeli, ngu abone kubahwerekyerereza kimwe, barekye kugirirwa embabazi, kureka bahwerekyerezibwe, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 1:28">Bir 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:23">Yer 3:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu biro ebyo Yoshua yaija, yaamaraho aba Anaki omu nsi y'ebibungo, n'omuri Heburooni, n'omuri Debira, n'omuri Anabu, kandi n'omu nsi yoona ey'ebibungo bya Yuda, n'ey'ebibungo bya Israeli; Yoshua yaabahwerekyerereza kimwe n'endembo zaabo. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:4">1 Sam 17:4</ref>. </char></note> Tihaine Muanaki n'omwe owaatsigaireho omu nsi y'Abaisraeli; kureka omuri Gaaza na Gaasi na Ashidoodi nimwo haatsigaire bamwe. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:44">Yos 21:44</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo Yoshua yaakwatsire atyo ensi yoona, nk'ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa byona oku byabaire biri, Yoshua yaagiha Abaisraeli kuba obuhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku enganda zaabo zaabaire ziri. Bwanyima ensi yaahuumura engamba.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'abagabe abu Yoshua yaabingire omu rugamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Aba nibo bagabe b'ensi, abu Abaisraeli baitsire, bakakubuura ensi yaabo seeri ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, okuruga omu ruhanga rwa Arunooni, okuhika aha rushozi Herumooni, na Araba yoona ey'oburugwa-izooba; <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori, owaabaire atwire Heshibooni, naategyeka okuruga Aroeri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni n'ahagati omu ruhita, n'ekicweka kya Gileadi okuhitsya aha mugyera Yaboki, omu mwatano gw'Abaamoni; <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />kandi okuruga Araba okuhitsya aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bw'enyanja Kineroosi n'aha muhanda ogurikuza Besi-yeshimoosi oburugwa-izooba bw'enyanja ya Araba, Enyanja y'omwonyo; kandi aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo okuhika ahansi y'akashuumo k'orushozi Pisiga. <verse eid="JOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Kandi na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani, omwe aha baatsigaireho omu Bareefa, owaabaire atwire Ashitaroosi na Edurei, <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />naategyeka orushozi Herumooni, na Saleka, na Bashani yoona okuhika aha mwatano gw'aba Geshuri n'aba Maaka, n'ekicweka kya Gileadi okuhika aha mwatano gwa Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Abo nibo Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA n'Abaisraeli baitsire; kandi ensi yaabo Musa akagiha Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase kuba eyaabo.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Kandi aba nibo bagabe b'ensi abu Yoshua n'Abaisraeli baitsire seenu ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba okuruga Baali-gaadi omu ruhanga rwa Lebanooni okuhika aha kibungo Halaki ogurikwinamuka Seiri; kandi egyo nsi niyo Yoshua yaahaire enganda za Israeli kuba eyaabo, nk'oku baagibaganisiziibwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />omu nsi y'ebibungo n'omu mpita n'omuri Araba n'omu nkiizi z'emigongo n'omu ihamba n'omuri Negebu, n'ensi y'Abahiiti n'ey'Abaamori n'ey'Abanyakanaani n'ey'Abaperizi n'ey'Abahiivi n'ey'Abayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Omugabe wa Yeriko omwe; omugabe wa Ai eri aha rubaju rwa Beseeli omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />omugabe wa Yerusaalemu omwe; omugabe wa Heburooni omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />omugabe wa Yaramuusi omwe; omugabe wa Lakishi omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />omugabe wa Egulooni omwe; omugabe wa Gezeri omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />omugabe wa Debira omwe; omugabe wa Gederi omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />omugabe wa Horuma omwe; omugabe wa Aradi omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />omugabe wa Libuna omwe; omugabe wa Adulaamu omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />omugabe wa Makeda omwe; omugabe wa Beseeli omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />omugabe wa Tapua omwe; omugabe wa Heferi omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />omugabe wa Afeki omwe; omugabe wa Lasharooni omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />omugabe wa Madoni omwe; omugabe wa Hazori omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />omugabe wa Shimurooni-meroni omwe; omugabe wa Akishaafu omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />omugabe wa Tanaki omwe, omugabe wa Megido omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />omugabe wa Kedeshi omwe, omugabe wa Yokineamu omuri Karumeeli omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />omugabe wa Doora omu bibungo bya Doori omwe; omugabe wa Goimu omuri Galilaaya omwe; <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />omugabe wa Tiruza omwe; abagabe boona makumi ashatu n'omwe.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okubagambira ebicweka ebitakakubwirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="OBA 1:17">Oba 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua ku yaakuzire, yaahika omu ngingo zaabukuru, MUKAMA yaamugira ati: okuzire, waahika omu ngingo zaabukuru; kwonka hakitsigaireyo ensi mpango munonga eshemereire kukubuurwa. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Ensi ekitsigaire n'egi; ebyanga byona eby'Abafilistia n'eby'aba Geshuri byona <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />(okwiha Shihoori eri aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Misri okuta aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aha mwatano gwa Ekurooni, n'ah'Abanyakanaani; kandi abategyeki bataano b'Abafilistia n'aba; owa Gaaza, owa Ashidoodi, owa Ashikelooni, owa Gaasi n'owa Ekurooni), n'eby'aba Avimu, <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />kandi aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, ensi yoona ey'Abanyakanaani, na Meara ey'aba Sidoni, okuhika Afeki aha mwatano gw'Abaamori, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />n'ensi y'aba Gebali na Lebanooni yoona aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, okuruga Baali-gaadi ahansi y'orushozi Herumooni okuhika ah'orikutaahira omuri Hamasi, <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />n'abatwire omu nsi y'ebibungo boona okuruga Lebanooni okuhika Miserofoosi-maimu, n'aba Sidoni boona, ndyababinga omu maisho g'Abaisraeli; kwonka ogibaganisize Abaisraeli kuba obuhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku naakuragiire. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati ensi egi ogibaganisize enganda mwenda n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase kuba obuhunguzi bwabo.<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:33">Kub 32:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekindi kicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase bakaba bahairwe obuhunguzi bwabo seeri ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, nka Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA oku yaabubahaire; <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />okuruga Aroeri eri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni, n'orurembo oruri ahagati y'orwo ruhanga, n'omurambi gwona ogwa Medeba okuhika Diboni; <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />n'endembo zoona eza Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamoni owaategyekyeire Heshibooni, okuhika aha mwatano gw'Abaamoni; <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />na Gileadi n'omu myatano y'aba Geshuri n'aba Maaka, n'orushozi rwa Herumooni rwona, na Bashani okuhika Saleka; <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />n'obugabe bwona obwa Ogi omuri Bashani, owaategyekyeire Ashitaroosi na Edurei, Ogi ogwo n'omwe ahari abo abaatsigaireho omu Bareefa; abo nibo Musa yaarwaine nabo akabinga. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Kwonka Abaisraeli bo tibarabingire ba Geshuri nari aba Maaka; kureka aba Geshuri n'aba Maaka bakituura nabo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Kub 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka oruganda rwa Leevi rwo Musa tararuhaire buhunguzi, kureka ebitambo ebyokize eby'okuhayo ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli nibwo buhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Musa yaaha oruganda rwa Reubeeni obuhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Ekyanga kyabo kikaba nikitandikira Aroeri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni, n'orurembo rw'ahagati yaarwo, n'omurambi gwona ogwa Medeba; <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />na Heshibooni n'endembo zaayo zoona eziri omu mirambi; na Diboni na Bamosi-baali na Besi-baali-meoni; <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />na Yahazi na Kedemoosi na Mefaasi; <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />na Kiryasaimu na Sibuma na Zeresi-shahaari aha kabungo akari omu ruhita; <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />na Besi-peori n'enkiizi za Pisiga, na Besi-yeshimoosi; <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />ezo nizo ndembo zoona ez'omu mirambi; n'obugabe bwona bwa Sihooni omugabe w'aba Amori, owaategyekyeire Heshibooni, ou Musa yaitsire hamwe n'abategyeki ba Midiani Evi, Rekemu, Zuuri, Huuri na Reeba, abanyiginya ba Sihooni abaabaire batwire omu nsi egyo.<verse eid="JOS 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 22:5">Kub 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15">2 Pet 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:14">Kush 2:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Balamu mwene Beori omufumu, Abaisraeli bakamwitsa rurara omuri abo abu baitsire. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Kandi omwatano gw'aba Reubeeni gukaba guri Yorudani. Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'aba Reubeeni, nk'oku emiryango yaabo n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo byabaire biri.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Kandi Musa yaaha oruganda rwa Gaadi obuhunguzi bwabo nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Ekyanga kyabo kikaba kiri Yazeri, n'endembo zoona eza Gileadi, n'ekicweka ky'ensi y'Abaamoni okuhitsya Aroeri aharikureebana na Rabba; <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />kandi okuruga Heshibooni okuhika Ramasi-mizipe na Betonimu; kandi okuruga Mahanaimu okuhika aha mwatano gwa Debira; <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />n'endembo z'omu ruhita, Besi-haramu, Besi-nimura, Sukoosi na Zafooni, n'ekicweka ky'obugabe bwa Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni ekyabaire kitsigaireho, omwatano gukaba guri Yorudani okuhika aha isheeshero ry'enyanja ya Kinereesi oburugwa-izooba bwa Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'aba Gaadi, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Kandi Musa yaaha ab'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase obuhunguzi bwabo, bwaba obw'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Ekyanga kyabo kikaba kiri okuruga Mahanaimu na Bashani yoona n'obugabe bwa Ogi omugabe wa Bashani bwona, na tauni zoona eza Yairi eziri omuri Bashani, endembo makumi mukaaga; <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />kandi ekicweka kya Gileadi na Ashitaroosi na Edurei, endembo z'omu bugabe bwa Ogi omuri Bashani bikaheebwa aba Makiri, mwene Manaase, ekicweka kya beene Makiri, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi obu Musa yaabaganiise omu mpita za Moabu seeri ya Yorudani, oburugwa-izooba bwa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:7">Yos 18:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka oruganda rwa Leevi rwo Musa tararuhaire buhunguzi bwona; kureka MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli niwe buhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku yaabagambiire.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 34:17">Kub 34:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obu nibwo buhunguzi obu Abaisraeli baahairwe omu nsi ya Kanaani, obu baabaganisiziibwe Eleazaari omunyamurwa na Yoshua mwene Nuuni n'abakuru b'emiryango y'enganda z'Abaisraeli; <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Kub 33:54</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:33">Enf 16:33</ref>. </char></note> obwo buhunguzi bwabo bakabubaganisiza enganda mwenda n'ekicweka n'enteenyu, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:15">Kub 34:15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Musa akaba yaahaire enganda ibiri n'ekicweka obuhunguzi bwazo seeri ya Yorudani; kwonka Abaleevi tarabahaire buhunguzi hamwe n'abo. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Abaana ba Yosefu bakakomookwamu enganda ibiri, Manaase na Efuraimu; kandi tibarahaire Baleevi mugabo omu nsi, kureka endembo z'okutuuramu, n'emyanya eri haihi nazo ey'amariisizo g'ente zaabo n'ey'ebintu byabo. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:2">Yos 21:2</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa, nikwo Abaisraeli baatwarize, bakabagana ensi.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kalebu okuheebwa Heburooni kuba obuhunguzi bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:12">Kub 32:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:36">Bir 1:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abayuda baashanga Yoshua Gilugaali; Kalebu mwene Yefune Omukenizi yaamugira ati: Noomanya eki MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga ahariiwe naanye, turi Kadeshi-barunea. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Nkaba nyine emyaka makumi ana, obu Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yantumira Kadeshi-barunea kutata ensi, kandi nkamureetera amakuru g'ebi naareebire nk'oku byabaire biri omu mutima gwangye. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Beene waitu, abu nainamukire nabo, baahahaaza emitima y'abantu; kwonka nyowe naakuratirira kimwe MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Eryo izooba nibwo Musa yaarahira ati: Buzimazima ensi ei oribatsiremu eryaba obuhunguzi bwawe n'obw'abaana baawe ebiro byona, ahabw'okuba okakuratirira kimwe MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye. <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:10">Zab 90:10</ref>. </char></note> Kalebu yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mbwenu reeba, MUKAMA andinzire emyaka egi makumi ana n'etaano, nk'oku yaagambire, okuruga obu MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ekigambo ekyo, Abaisraeli nibakizengyerera omu ihamba; mbwenu reeba, hati mpikize emyaka makumi munaana n'etaano. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:7">Bir 34:7</ref>. </char></note> Na hati nkiine amaani nk'agu naabaire nyine, obu Musa yantuma. Nk'amaani gangye oku gaabaire gari aha rugamba, nimpurura kandi nintabaaruka, na hati nikwo gakiri. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">2 Bus 14:11</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 14:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:3">Zab 44:3</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:13">Fil 4:13</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ompe ensi y'ebibungo, ei MUKAMA yaagambireho eryo izooba; ahakuba nk'oku waahuriire buri, na mbwenu Abaanaki bariyo, kandi baine endembo mpango ezeehinguririziibwe engo zigumire. Shana MUKAMA aryaguma naanye, mbabingye, nk'oku yaagambire. <verse eid="JOS 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:20">Bar 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaashabira Kalebu mwene Yefune omugisha, yaamuha Heburooni kuba obuhunguzi bwe. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo Heburooni yaahinduka obuhunguzi bwa Kalebu mwene Yefune Omukenizi n'okuhitsya hati, ahabw'okuba akakuratirira kimwe MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />(Kandi obunyakare Heburooni ekaba neeyetwa Kiryasi-araba; Araba ogwo akaba ari omuntu mukuru rugambwa omu Baanaki.) Bwanyima ensi yaahuumura engamba.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga eki Abayuda baabagaine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Ekyanga eki oruganda rw'Abayuda baabagaine, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, kikaba nikihika aha mwatano gwa Edomu, omu ihamba rya Ziini aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, okuhikira kimwe aha muheru gw'orubaju orwo; <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />kandi omwatano gwabo ogw'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo gukaba niguruga aha muheru gw'Enyanja y'omwonyo, aha mukono gw'enyanja ogurikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo; <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />gwogamu guhika aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aharikwinamuka Akarabiimu, gugumizamu guhika Ziini, gwinamuka aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bwa Kadeshi-barunea, guraba haihi na Hezirooni, gwinamuka guhika Adari, gukiikama guhika Karaka; <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />okuruga aho gugumizamu guhika Azimooni, gwogamu, gushuuma n'akagyera ka Misri, gugarukira aha nyanja; ogwo nigwo guriba omwatano gwanyu aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo. <verse eid="JOS 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Kandi omwatano gwabo ogw'oburugwa-izooba gukaba guri Enyanja y'omwonyo okuhika ahu Yorudani egishukiramu. Kandi omwatano ogw'orubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho guruga aha mukono gw'enyanja ahu Yorudani erikugishukiramu; <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />omwatano ogwo gwinamuka guhika Besi-hogola, guraba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bwa Besaraba; gugumizamu guhika aha ibaare rya Bohani mwene Reubeeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kandi gugumizamu niguruga omu ruhanga rwa Akori, guhika Debira, gutyo gutoora aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, nigureeba Gilugaali ahateegaine n'aharikwinamuka Adumimu, eri aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo obw'oruhanga; ogwo mwatano gugumizamu guraba aha maizi ga Enishemeshi, gugarukira Eni-rogeli; <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />okuruga aho omwatano gwinamuka, guraba omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu oruri aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'ensi y'Abayebusi, (niyo Yerusaalemu); gwinamuka guhika aha mutwe gw'ekibungo ekiri omu maisho g'oruhanga rwa Hinoomu orubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, kandi ekiri aha muheru gw'oruhanga rw'Abareefa aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho; <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />bwanyima omwatano guruga aha mutwe gw'ekyo kibungo okuhika aha nshuro y'amaizi ga Nefutoa, gwogamu guhika aha ndembo z'aha kibungo kya Efurooni; guhika Baala, niyo Kiryasi-yearimu; <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />okuruga Baala omwatano gukiikama gutoora oburengyerwa-izooba, guhika aha kibungo Seiri, guraba aha rubaju rw'ekibungo Yearimu aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, niyo Kesalooni; gushuuma guhika Beti-shemeshi, gwogamu guraba aha rubaju rwa Timuna; <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />gugumizamu guhika aha rubaju rwa Ekurooni aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho; guhika Shikerooni, gwogamu guhika aha kibungo Baala, gugumizamu guhika Yabuneeli; gugarukira aha nyanja. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Kandi n'omwatano ogw'oburengyerwa-izooba gukaba guri Enyanja empango. Ogwo nigwo mwatano gw'Abayuda nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kalebu okukubuura ekyanga eki yaahairwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 14:13">Yos 14:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yoshua yaaha Kalebu mwene Yefune omugabo omu kyanga ky'Abayuda, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Yoshua, niyo Kiryasi-araba, erikwetwa Heburooni; (Araba ogwo niwe ishe wa Anaki). <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kalebu ogwo yaabingamu batabani ba Anaki bashatu, Sheshai, Ahimaanu na Talumai, baijukuru ba Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Okuruga aho yainamuka, yaateera aba Debira; kandi obunyakare eiziina rya Debira rikaba riri Kiryasi-seferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kandi Kalebu yaagira ati: Oraateere Kiryasi-seferi, akagikwata, niinyija kumuhingira muhara wangye Akisa. <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:9">Bar 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Otinieli mwene Kenazi, murumuna wa Kalebu, yaagikwata; onu yaamuhingira muhara we Akisa. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:14">Bar 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaamutaahize, Akisa yaayeshengyereza iba kushaba ishe-zaara ekibanja; ku yaarugire aha ndogoya ye, Kalebu yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda ki? <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Ontambire! Nk'oku ontaire omu nsi ya Negebu, ogarukye ompe ahaine enshuro z'amaizi. Kalebu nikwo kumuha enshuro z'eruguru n'eza ifo.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'Abayuda nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Endembo z'oruganda rw'Abayuda eziri aha muheru gw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, aha rubaju rw'omwatano gwa Edomu nizo ezi. Kabuzieli, Ederi, Yaguri, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kiina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedeshi, Hazori, Itunaanu, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Ziifu, Telemu, Bealoosi, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hazori-Hadata, Keriosi-hezirooni, niyo Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amamu, Sheema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hazari-gaada, Heshimooni, Besipeleeti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hazari-shuali, Beeri-sheba, Bizyotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala, Iyimu, Ezeemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Elitolaadi, Kesili, Horuma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Zikulaagi, Madimana, Sani-sana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebaosi, Shilihimu, Aini na Rimoni; endembo zoona makumi abiri na mwenda n'ebirorero byazo.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />N'ez'omu mpita, Eshitaoli, Zoora, Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanoa, Eniganimu, Tapua, Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yaramuusi, Adulaamu, Sooko, Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Sharaimu, Aditaimu, Gedeerana, Gederosaimu, endembo ikumi na ina n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Zenani, Hadasha, Migudaligadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dileani, Mizipe, Yokiseeli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakishi, Bozikaasi, Egulooni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kaboni, Lahimani, Kitiliishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederoosi, Besidagoni, Naama, na Makeda, endembo ikumi na mukaaga n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libuna, Eteeri, Ashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ifuta, Ashuna, Nezibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Akiziibuna, Mareesha, endembo mwenda n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekurooni na tauni zaarwo n'ebirorero byarwo; <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />okuruga aha Ekurooni okuhika aha Nyanja, endembo zoona ezaabaire ziri aha rubaju rwa Ashidoodi n'ebirorero byazo; <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />na Ashidoodi na tauni zaarwo n'ebirorero byarwo; na Gaaza na tauni zaarwo n'ebirorero byarwo, okuhika aha kagyera ka Misri n'aha Nyanja empango.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />N'ez'omu nsi y'enshozi, Shamira, Yatiri, Sooko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Daana, Kiryasi-sana, niyo Debira, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anabu, Eshitemo, Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gosheni, Holoni, na Giilo; endembo ikumi na rumwe n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arabu, Duma, Eshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanimu, Besi-tapua, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humita, Kiryasi-araba, niyo Heburooni, na Ziori, endembo mwenda n'ebirorero byazo, <verse eid="JOS 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Maoni, Karumeeli, Ziifu, Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yezereeli, Yokideamu, Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kaini, Gibea, na Timuna; endembo ikumi n'ebirorero byazo; <verse eid="JOS 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Halihuli, Besi-zuuri, Gedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarasi, Besanoosi na Elitekoni; endembo mukaaga n'ebirorero byazo; <verse eid="JOS 15:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiryasi-baali, niyo Kiryasi-yearimu, na Rabba; endembo ibiri n'ebirorero byazo.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />N'ez'omu ihamba, Besaraba, Midudiini, Sekaaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibushani orurembo rw'omwonyo, na Eni-geedi; endembo mukaaga n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 15:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:8">Bar 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 1:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abayebusi abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu, Abayuda tibarabaasize kubabinga; n'ahabw'ekyo Abayebusi bakatuura Yerusaalemu hamwe n'Abayuda n'okuhitsya eri izooba.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Emyatano y'ebyanga by'aba Yosefu na Efuraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Ekyanga eki baijukuru ba Yosefu baabagaine kikaba nikitandikira Yorudani haihi na Yeriko, aha maizi gaayo omu ihamba, omwatano guruga Yeriko, gwinamuka Beseeli niguraba omu nsi y'ebibungo; <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />guruga Beseeli, guza Luuzi, guraba aha mwatano gw'aba Aruki, guhika Ataroosi; <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />gushuuma oburengyerwa-izooba guhika aha mwatano gw'aba Yafileeti, kandi guhika aha mwatano gwa Besihoroni eya ifo, niyo Gezeri; gugarukira aha Nyanja. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:14">Yos 17:14</ref>. </char></note> Baijukuru ba Yosefu, abaana ba Manaase na Efuraimu, baaheebwa obuhunguzi bwabo.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Omwatano gw'ekyanga kya beene Efuraimu nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, gukaba guri guti; omwatano gw'obuhunguzi bwabo oburugwa-izooba gukaba nigutandikira Ataroosi-adari, guhika Besi-horoni ey'eruguru; <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />ahari Mikemeesa aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho gwogamu gutoora oburengyerwa-izooba; bwanyima gukiikama gutoora oburugwa-izooba, guhika Tanati-shiilo, gugiraba haihi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba okuhika Yanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Okuruga Yanoa gushuuma guza Ataroosi na Naara; guhika Yeriko, gugarukira Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kandi omwatano guruga Tapua gugumizamu oburengyerwa-izooba, guhika aha kagyera Kaana; gugarukira aha Nyanja. Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'Abaefuraimu, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />hamwe n'endembo ezaabatooraniirwe omu kyanga ky'obuhunguzi bw'Abamanaase, endembo zoona n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:20">1 Bag 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 17:12">Yos 17:12</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 17:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tibarabingiremu Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire Gezeri; n'ahabw'ekyo Abanyakanaani bakatuura omu Baefuraimu n'okuhitsya eri izooba, kwonka baahinduka abahuuku b'okubakorera.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s1">Obuhunguzi bw'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:51">Kut 41:51</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:18">48:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:23">50:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:15">Bir 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo baabaganisiize oruganda rwa Manaase, ahabw'okuba omujigaijo gwa Yosefu. Kandi Makiri omujigaijo gwa Manaase, ishenkuru wa Gileadi, akaheebwa ebyanga bya Gileadi na Bashani, ahakuba akaba ari emanzi omu ngamba. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Kandi baijukuru ba Manaase abaatsigaireho baababaganisiza, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri; abo nibo, Abiezeeri, Heleki, Asirieli, Shekemu, Heferi, na Shemiida, batabani ba Manaase mwene Yosefu, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:1-7">Kub 27:1-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Zelofehaadi mwene Heferi, mwene Gileadi, mwene Makiri, mwene Manaase, tarazaire boojo, kureka abaishiki; kandi aga nigo maziina gaabo, Maala, Noa, Hogula, Milika na Tiruza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Baimuka baashanga Eleazaari omunyamurwa, na Yoshua mwene Nuuni, n'abakuru b'eihanga, baagira bati: MUKAMA akaragiira Musa kutuha obuhunguzi na banyaanyaitwe. Nikyo Yoshua yaabaheereire obuhunguzi na beene ishe, nk'ekiragiro kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Abamanaase baaheebwa ebicweka ikumi, otabariiremu ebyanga bya Gileadi na Bashani seeri ya Yorudani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />ahabw'okuba bahara ba Manaase bakaheebwa obuhunguzi na baanyaanyabo; kandi Abamanaase abandi baaheebwa ekyanga kya Gileadi.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Omwatano gw'ekyanga ky'Abamanaase gukaba gutandikira Asheri, guhika Mikemeesa, eri kureeba Shekemu; gugumizamu aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, guhika omu bantu abatwire Eni-tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Kandi ekyanga kya Tapua kikaba kiri ekya Manaase, kwonka Tapua aha mwatano gwa Manaase ekaba eri ey'Abaefuraimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Gutyo omwatano gushuuma, guhika aha kagyera Kaana aha rubaju rwako rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo; endembo ezo zikaba ziri ez'Abaefuraimu ahagati omu ndembo za Manaase; kandi omwatano gwa Manaase gukaba guri aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'ako kagyera; nigugarukira aha Nyanja. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo ekaba eri eya Efuraimu, kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho eri eya Manaase; n'enyanja ekaba eri omwatano gwe; kandi aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho baahika aha kyanga kya Asheri, kandi oburugwa-izooba bahika aha kya Isakaari. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Kandi omu byanga bya Isakaari na Asheri, aba Manaase bakaheebwa Besi-sheani na tauni zaarwo, Ibuleamu na tauni zaarwo, n'abantu abatwire Doori na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Endoori na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Tanaki na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Megido na tauni zaarwo, nibyo bibungo bishatu. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:29-33">Kur 23:29-33</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka aba Manaase tibarabaasize kubinga abantu abaabaire batwire omu ndembo ezo, kureka Abanyakanaani bakenda kuguma batwire omu nsi egyo. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Kwonka Abaisraeli ku baaherize kuhama, baakoresa Abanyakanaani emirimo y'obuhuuku, tibaababingiramu kimwe.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 16:4">Yos 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:19">Kut 48:19</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:34">Kub 26:34</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 26:37">37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baijukuru ba Yosefu baabuuza Yoshua bati: Ahabw'enki otuhaire omugabo gw'ekyanga kimwe omu kicweka kimwe kuba obuhunguzi bwaitu; haza turi oruganda ruhango, kandi MUKAMA atuhaire omugisha n'okuhitsya hati? <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yoshua yaabagarukamu ati: Ku muraabe muri oruganda ruhango, mwinamukye muze omu kibira ky'omu nsi y'Abaperizi n'aba Reefa, mukyetemere, mweshanze; ahabw'okuba ensi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu efunzire munonga ahariimwe. <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:19">Bar 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:3">4:3</ref>. </char></note> Aba Yosefu baagira bati: Ensi y'ebibungo terikutuhika; kandi Abanyakanaani boona abatwire omu nsi y'empita baine ebigaari by'ebyoma, nibo ba Besi-sheani na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire omu ruhita rwa Yezereeli. <verse eid="JOS 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Yoshua nikwo kugambira ab'omuryango gwa Yosefu, nibo ba Efuraimu n'aba Manaase, ati: N'ekya buzima muri oruganda ruhango, kandi mwine amaani maingi; timushemereire kuheebwa omugabo gw'ekyanga kimwe kyonka; <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:1">Bir 20:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:4-6">Yos 11:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> kureka ensi y'ebibungo eryaba eyaanyu; n'obu eraabe eri ey'ekibira, muryakitema, mukikubuure okuhika aha muheru gwakyo; ahakuba Abanyakanaani, n'obu baraabe baine ebigaari by'ebyoma, kandi bari ab'amaani, muryababinga.<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okutuma entumwa z'okureeba ensi eyaabaire etakabaganisiibwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 21:19">Bar 21:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:58-60">Zab 78:58-60</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:3">1 Sam 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihanga ryona ry'Abaisraeli ryateeranira hamwe Shiilo; baimutsyayo Eihema ry'okuteeraniramu. Ensi yaabagomookyera. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Kwonka omu Baisraeli hakaba hatsigaire enganda mushanju, ezaabaire zitakahairwe buhunguzi bwazo. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:9">Bar 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:16">Zef 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:27">Yoh 6:27</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:13">Fil 3:13</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 3:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaagambira Abaisraeli ati: Muryahitsya hi okweganda kuza kukubuura ensi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe yaabahaire? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Mbwenu mutoorane abashaija bashatu omuri buri ruganda; naanye ndyaboohereza, baimukye, bagyendagyende omu nsi, beetegyereze ensi y'obuhunguzi bwabo oku erikushusha, haza bagarukye ahariinye. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Kandi baryagibaganisa omu bicweka mushanju; Abayuda baryaguma omu kyanga kyabo aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'aba Yosefu bagume omu kyabo aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:2">Yos 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Muryabaganisa ensi omu bicweka mushanju, mubireete aha, mubinshobororere; naanye ndyagibabaganisiriza n'enteenyu omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Kub 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 13:8">Yos 13:8</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaleevi tibaine mugabo omuriimwe, ahakuba obunyamurwa bwa MUKAMA nibwo buhunguzi bwabo; n'Abagaadi n'Abareubeeni, n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, baaherize kuheebwa obuhunguzi bwabo oburugwa-izooba seeri ya Yorudani, obu Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabahaire.<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Abo bashaija ku baabaire nibaimuka kugyenda kushoboorora ensi, Yoshua yaabeehanangiriza ati: Mugyende omu nsi yoona, muhandikye emyatano yaayo, mugarukye ahi ndi; naanye ndyagibabaganisiriza aha Shiilo omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Abashaija abo baagyenda, baaraba omuri egyo nsi, baahandika ebicweka byayo mushanju omu kitabo, nibooreka n'endembo zaamwo; bwanyima baagaruka ahari Yoshua omu rusiisira Shiilo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:33">Enf 16:33</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaabateerera enteenyu ari omuri Shiilo omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Aho niho Yoshua yaabaganisiriize Abaisraeli ensi, nk'enganda zaabo oku zaabaire ziri.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabo gw'ekyanga ky'aba Benyamiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Omugabo gw'oruganda rwa Benyamiini gwaija nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri; kandi omwatano gw'ekyanga kyabo gukaba gutandikira ahagati y'eky'Abayuda n'eky'aba Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Kandi omwatano gwabo aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, gukaba gutandikira Yorudani, gwinamuka, guraba aha rubaju rwa Yeriko aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, gugumizamu guraba omu nsi y'ebibungo oburengyerwa-izooba, gugarukira aha ihamba rya Besaveeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Okuruga aho guza Luuzi, niyo Beseeli, aha rubaju rwayo rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, gushuuma guhika Ataroosi-adari, haihi n'ekibungo ekiri aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bwa Besi-horoni eya ifo. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba gukiikama gutoora obukiizi-bwa-buryo, okuruga aha kibungo ekirikureeba Besi-horoni aha rubaju rwa buryo, gugarukira Kiryasi-baali, niyo Kiryasi-yearimu orurembo rw'Abayuda; orubaju orwo nirwo rw'oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Kandi orubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo gutandikira aha muheru gwa Kiryasi-yearimu, gutoora oburengyerwa-izooba, guhika aha nshuro z'amaizi za Nefutoa; <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />gushuuma, guhika aha muheru gw'ekibungo, ekirikureebana n'oruhanga rwa beene Hinoomu, kandi ekiri aha muheru gw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'oruhanga rwa Reefa; gushuuma omu ruhanga rwa Hinoomu, okuhika aha rubaju rw'Abayebusi aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, gugumizamu gushuuma Eni-rogeli; <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />gukiikama, gutoora obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, guza Eni-shemeshi, gugumizamu guza Elilooti, erikureebana n'aharikwinamuka Adumimu; gushuuma guhika aha rukiri rwa Bohani mwene Reubeeni; <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />gugumizamu guraba aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho bwa Besaraba, gushuuma guhika Araba; <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />kandi gwogamu guhika aha rubaju rwa Besi-hogola aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, gugarukira aha mukono gw'Enyanja y'omwonyo, ogw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aha isheeshero rya Yorudani; ogwo nigwo mwatano gw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Kandi Yorudani niyo yaabaire eri omwatano gwayo aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba. Ekyo nikyo kyanga ky'obuhunguzi bw'aba Benyamiini, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, n'emyatano yaakyo oku yaabaire eri aha mbaju zoona. <verse eid="JOS 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Kandi endembo z'oruganda rwa Benyamiini, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, nizo ezi; Yeriko, Besi-hogola, Emekezizi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Besaraba, Zemaraimu, Beseeli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avimu, Paara, Ofura, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefaramooni, Ofuni na Geeba; endembo ikumi na ibiri n'ebirorero byazo; <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Gibeoni, Raama, Beeroosi, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mizipe, Kefira, Mooza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekemu, Irupeeli, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Zeela, Elefu na Yebusi, niyo Yerusaalemu, Gibeasi, na Kiryasi; endembo ikumi na ina n'ebirorero byazo. Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'Ababenyamiini nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ebyanga by'ezindi nganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:7">Kut 49:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabo gwa kabiri gwaija guri ogwa Simeoni, nirwo ruganda rw'Abasimeoni nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri; ekyanga ky'obuhunguzi bwabo kikaba kiri ahagati y'eky'obuhunguzi bw'Abayuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Endembo ezi baahairwe kuba obuhunguzi bwabo nizo ezi; Beeri-sheba nari Sheba, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hazari-shuali, Baala, Ezeemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Elitolaadi, Besuula, Horuma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Zikulaagi, Besi-marikaboosi, Hazaari-suusa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Besi-lebaosi, na Sharuheni; endembo ikumi na ishatu n'ebirorero byazo; <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Aini, Rimona, Eteeri, na Ashani; endembo ina n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />N'ebirorero byona ebyehinguririize ezo ndembo okuhika Baalasibeero, niyo Raama y'obukiizi-bwa-buryo. Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Simeoni, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Obuhunguzi bw'Abasimeoni bukaihwa omu bw'Abayuda, ahakuba ekyanga ky'Abayuda kikaba kiri kihango munonga, nikibakira; nikyo kyareeteire oruganda rwa Simeoni kuheebwa obuhunguzi ahagati y'obw'Abayuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga ky'oruganda rwa Zebuluuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Omugabo gwa kashatu gwaija, guri ogw'oruganda rwa Zebuluuni, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. Omwatano gw'obuhunguzi bwabo gukaba guhika Sarida; <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />gwinamuka gutoora oburengyerwa-izooba, guhika Marala na Dabesheesi; gugumizamu guhika aha kagyera akari omu maisho ga Yokineamu; <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />okuruga Sarida gukiikama gutoora oburugwa-izooba, guhika aha mwatano gwa Kisiloosi-tabora; guruga aho, guhika Daberaasi, gwinamuka guhika Yafia; <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />guruga aho guraba aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, guhika Gaasi-heferi na Eti-kaziini, gwogamu guhika Rimoni, gutoora Nea; <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho gukiikama gutoora Hanatooni, gugarukira omu ruhanga rwa Ifusaheeli; <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />kandi baheebwa Kataasi, Nahalaali, Shimirooni, Idala na Betelehemu; endembo ikumi na ibiri n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'Abazebuluuni, nizo ndembo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga ky'oruganda rwa Isakaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Omugabo gwa kana gwaija guri ogwa Isakaari, nirwo ruganda rw'Abaisakaari, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Ekyanga kyabo kikaba kirimu endembo ezi; Yezereeli, Kesuloosi, Shuneemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafaraimu, Shioni, Anaharaasi, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabisi, Kishioni, Ebeza, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remesi, Eni-ganimu, Eni-haada, na Besi-pazezi; <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />kandi omwatano guhika Tabora, Shahazuma, na Beti-shemeshi, gugarukira Yorudani; endembo ikumi na mukaaga n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Isakaari, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga ky'oruganda rwa Asheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Omugabo gwa kataano gwaija guri ogw'oruganda rwa Asheri, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Ekyanga kyabo kikaba kirimu endembo ezi; Helukaasi, Haali, Beeteni, Akisaafu, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alameleki, Amadi, na Mishaali; kandi aha burengyerwa-izooba, omwatano guhika Karumeeli na Shihori-libunaasi; <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />gukiikama gutoora oburugwa-izooba, guhika Besi-dagoni, gugumizamu guhika Zebuluuni, n'omu ruhanga rwa Ifusaheeli aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, guhika Besi-emeki, na Neyeli; gugarukira Kaabuli aha rubaju rwa bumosho, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />na Eburooni, Rehobu, Hamoni na Kaana, n'okuhika Sidoni empango; <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />bwanyima gukiikama gutoora Raama, guhika aha rurembo rw'orugo orugumire Turo; okuruga aho gukiikama gutoora Hoosa; gugarukira aha nyanja haihi na Akiziibu; <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />kandi baheebwa Umma na Afeki na Rehobu; endembo makumi abiri na ibiri n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Asheri, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga ky'oruganda rwa Nafutaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Omugabo gwa mukaaga gwaija guri ogw'oruganda rwa Nafutaali, nibo Banafutaali nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Omwatano gwabo gukaba gutandikira Helefi, aha muti ogurikwetwa omwela oguri Zaananimu, guraba Adami-nekebu, na Yabuneeli, guhika Lakumu, gugarukira Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba gukiikama, guhika Azinoosi-tabora; okuruga aho guraba Hukooki, guhika Zebuluuni aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, kandi guhika Asheri aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, kandi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba guhika Yuda ahari Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Kandi endembo zaabo ez'engo ezigumire nizo ezi; Zidimu, Zeera, Hamasi, Rakasi, Kinereesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Raama, Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedeshi, Edurei, Enihazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Irooni, Migudaleeli, Horemu, Besanaasi, na Beti-shemeshi; endembo ikumi na mwenda n'ebirorero byazo. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Nafutaali, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyanga ky'oruganda rwa Daani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Omugabo gwa mushanju gwaija guri ogw'oruganda rwa Daani, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Ekyanga ky'obuhunguzi bwabo kikaba kirimu endembo ezi, Zoora, Eshitaoli, Irishemeshi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Shaalabiina, Ayalooni, Itula, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Eloni, Timuna, Ekurooni, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Eliteeke, Gibesooni, Baalasi, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehudi, Beneberaaki, Gaasi-rimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Meyarikooni, na Rakooni, okuhika aha mwatano ogurikureeba Yoopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:1">Bar 18:1</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 18:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ekyanga ky'aba Daani kubabeera kikye, bakainamuka, baateera Leshemu, baagikwata, baagihwerekyereza na rurara, baagikubuura, baagituuramu. Leshemu egyo baagyeta Daani, nibagyeterera ishenkurubo Daani. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Daani, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhunguzi bwa Yoshua mwene Nuuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Ku baaherize kubaganisa ensi omu bicweka byayo, nk'emyatano y'obuhunguzi bwabo oku eri, Abaisraeli baha Yoshua mwene Nuuni obuhunguzi ahagati yaabo; <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:30">Yos 24:30</ref>. </char></note> baamuha orurembo oru yaabashabire, orurikwetwa Timunaati-seera omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, nk'ekiragiro kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. Yaayombekayo orurembo, yaarutuuramu.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 34:17">Kub 34:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 18:10">Yos 18:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo buhunguzi, obu Eleazaari omunyamurwa, Yoshua mwene Nuuni n'abakuru b'emiryango y'enganda za Israeli, baabaganiise n'enteenyu, nibaziteerera Shiilo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. Okwo nikwo baaherize batyo kubagana ensi.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Endembo z'okuhungiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Yoshua ati: <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:13">Kur 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:6-14">Kub 35:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:41-43">Bir 4:41-43</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Mwetooranire endembo z'okuhungiramu, ezi naaragiire Musa kubagambira, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />ngu oriita omuntu weena atamwitsire nkana, nari atakimanyire ahungireyo; ziryaba obuhungiro bwanyu bw'okuhungiramu omuhoozi w'enzigu. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rus 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 4:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ogwo aryahungira omuri rumwe aha ndembo ezo; ku arihikayo, ayemerere aha irembo ry'orwo rurembo, agambire abakuru baarwo eki akozire; nabo baryamutaasya omu rurembo, bamuhe omwanya, atuure nabo. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Omuhoozi ku arimukuratayo, batarimumuha kumuhoora, ahabw'okuba taraitsire mutaahi we nkana, kandi akashangwa atarikwangana nawe. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Aryaguma omuri orwo rurembo, okuhitsya obu aryemerera omu maisho g'omutwe gw'abantu kucwerwa orubanja, kandi hoona tarirugamu, okuhitsya obu omunyamurwa omukuru, oriba ariho omu bunaku obwo, arifa; bwanyima ogwo mwitsi nibwo arigaruka owaabo omu ka ye, omu rurembo oru yaacwiremu.<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 21:32">Yos 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 6:67-76">1 Bus 6:67-76</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aho baayetooranira Kedeshi omuri Galilaaya omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Nafutaali, na Shekemu omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, na Kiryasi-araba, niyo Heburooni omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Kandi seeri ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Yeriko, baatooranayo Bezeeri aha murambi gw'omu ihamba omu kyanga ky'oruganda rwa Reubeeni, na Ramosi omuri Gileadi omu kyanga ky'oruganda rwa Gaadi, na Golani omuri Bashani omu kyanga ky'oruganda rwa Manaase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:15">Kub 35:15</ref>. </char></note> Ezo nizo ndembo ezaatooraniirwe Abaisraeli boona n'abanyamahanga abaabaire babashuhuukiiremu, ngu omuntu weena oraite omuntu, atamwitsire nkana, ahungireyo, arekye kwitwa omuhoozi w'enzigu, okuhitsya obu aryemerera omu maisho g'omutwe gw'abantu.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Endembo z'Abaleevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Bwanyima abakuru b'emiryango y'oruganda rwa Leevi baija ahari Eleazaari omunyamurwa na Yoshua mwene Nuuni n'abakuru b'emiryango y'enganda za Israeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:2">Kub 35:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:9-18">Ezk 48:9-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:6">Gal 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:17">1 Tim 5:17</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 5:18">18</ref>. </char></note> baabagambirira Shiilo omu nsi ya Kanaani, bati: MUKAMA akaragiira Musa ku tuheebwa endembo z'okutuuramu n'amariisizo gaazo ahabw'amatungo gaitu. <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Abaisraeli nikwo kuha Abaleevi endembo n'amariisizo gaazo ahari ezo ezi baahungwire, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Enteenyu yaakwata ab'emiryango y'aba Kohasi; Abaleevi baijukuru ba Arooni omunyamurwa bo baakwatwa enteenyu, baaheebwa endembo ikumi na ishatu omu ruganda rwa Yuda, n'omu rwa Simeoni n'omu rwa Benyamiini. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Baijukuru ba Kohasi abaatsigaire batahairwe, enteenyu yaabakwata, baaheebwa endembo ikumi omu ruganda rwa Efuraimu n'omu rwa Daani n'omu kicweka ky'orwa Manaase. <verse eid="JOS 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Enteenyu yaakwata baijukuru ba Gereshoni, baaheebwa endembo ikumi na ishatu omu miryango y'oruganda rwa Isakaari, n'omu rwa Asheri, n'omu rwa Nafutaali, n'omu kicweka ky'orwa Manaase omuri Bashani. <verse eid="JOS 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Kandi na baijukuru ba Merari, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, baheebwa endembo ikumi na ibiri omu ruganda rwa Reubeeni, n'omu rwa Gaadi, n'omu rwa Zebuluuni. <verse eid="JOS 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baahaire Abaleevi ezo ndembo n'amariisizo gaazo nibateera enteenyu, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa ku baziheebwa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Omu ndembo z'oruganda rwa Yuda n'orwa Simeoni baabaha endembo ezi, ezi amaziina gaazo garikugambwaho ahaifo. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Haabanza beene Arooni, ow'omu miryango y'aba Kohasi, ab'omuri baijukuru ba Leevi; ahabw'okuba omugabo gw'okubanza gukaba guri ogwabo. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:2">Kut 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:15">Yos 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:13">15:13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:1-3">2 Sam 2:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Baabaha Kiryasi-araba, orurembo rwa Araba, ishe wa Anaki, niyo Heburooni ey'omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Yuda n'amariisizo gaayo; <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />kwonka emisiri yaarwo n'ebirorero byarwo bikaba byahairwe Kalebu mwene Yefune kuba obutaka bwe.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Beene Arooni omunyamurwa baabaha Heburooni n'amariisizo gaayo, nirwo rurembo rw'okuhungirwamu oitsire omuntu, na Libuna n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yatiri n'amariisizo gaayo, Eshitemoa n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holoni n'amariisizo gaayo, Debira n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Aini n'amariisizo gaayo, Yuta n'amariisizo gaayo, na Beti-shemeshi n'amariisizo gaayo; endembo z'enganda ezo zombi zaaba mwenda. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Kandi n'omu ruganda rwa Benyamiini, baabaha Gibeoni n'amariisizo gaayo, Geeba n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatoosi n'amariisizo gaayo, na Alumooni n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Endembo zoona eza beene Arooni abanyamurwa zaaba ikumi na ishatu n'amariisizo gaazo.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Ab'emiryango ya beene Kohasi, b'aba Leevi, nibo baijukuru ba Kohasi abaatsigaire batahairwe, bo baaheebwa endembo z'omugabo gwabo omu z'oruganda rwa Efuraimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Baabaha Shekemu n'amariisizo gaayo omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, nirwo rurembo rw'okuhungirwamu oitsire omuntu, na Gezeri n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibuzaimu n'amariisizo gaayo, na Besi-horoni n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />N'omu z'oruganda rwa Daani baabaha Eliteeke n'amariisizo gaayo, Gibesooni n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Ayalooni n'amariisizo gaayo, na Gaasi-rimoni n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Kandi omu z'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase baabaha Tanaki n'amariisizo gaayo na Gaasi-rimoni n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ibiri. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Endembo zoona ez'emiryango ya beene Kohasi, abaatsigaire batahairwe zaaba ikumi n'amariisizo gaazo.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Kandi beene Gereshoni, ab'omu miryango y'aba Leevi baabaha endembo ibiri ez'omu z'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, Golani ey'omuri Bashani, orurembo rw'okuhungirwamu oitsire omuntu, n'amariisizo gaayo, na Beshiteera n'amariisizo gaayo. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />N'omu z'oruganda rwa Isakaari baabaha Kishioni n'amariisizo gaayo, Deberaati n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yaramuusi n'amariisizo gaayo, na Eni-ganimu n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />N'omu z'oruganda rwa Asheri baabaha Mishaali n'amariisizo gaayo, Abudooni n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helukaasi n'amariisizo gaayo, na Rehobu n'amariisizo gaayo; endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Kandi n'omu z'oruganda rwa Nafutaali baabaha Kedeshi omuri Galilaaya n'amariisizo gaayo, orurembo rw'okuhungirwamu oitsire omuntu, Hamosi-doori n'amariisizo gaayo, na Karitaani n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ishatu. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Endembo zoona z'aba Gereshoni, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, zaaba ikumi na ishatu n'amariisizo gaazo. <verse eid="JOS 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Kandi ab'emiryango ya beene Merari, nibo ba Leevi abaatsigaire batahairwe, baaheebwa omu ndembo z'oruganda rwa Zebuluuni Yokineamu n'amariisizo gaayo, Karita n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimuna n'amariisizo gaayo, na Nahalaali n'amariisizo gaayo, endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />N'omu z'oruganda rwa Reubeeni, baabaha Bezeeri n'amariisizo gaayo, Yahazi n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemoosi n'amariisizo gaayo na Mefaasi n'amariisizo gaayo endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Kandi n'omu z'oruganda rwa Gaadi baabaha Ramosi omuri Gileadi n'amariisizo gaayo, orurembo rw'okuhungirwamu oitsire omuntu, Mahanaimu n'amariisizo gaayo, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Heshibooni n'amariisizo gaayo, na Yazeri n'amariisizo gaayo, zoona zaaba endembo ina. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Endembo ezo zoona nizo zaabaire ziri eza beene Merari nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, niyo miryango y'Abaleevi eyaatsigaire etahairwe; omugabo gwabo gukaba guri endembo ikumi na ibiri. <verse eid="JOS 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:10">Bir 33:10</ref>. </char></note> Endembo zoona z'Abaleevi ezaabaire ziri ahagati omu butaka bw'Abaisraeli zikaba ziri makumi ana na munaana n'amariisizo gaazo. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Ezo ndembo buri rumwe rukaba rwehinguririziibwe amariisizo gaarwo; kandi ezo ndembo zoona nikwo zaabaire ziri.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaahaire Abaisraeli ensi yoona ei yaarahiire kuha baishenkurubo; batyo baagikubuura, baagituuramu. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Yos 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:24">Bir 7:24</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaabaha okuhuumura embaju zoona, nk'oku yaaraganiise baishenkurubo; omu bazigu baabo boona tihariho n'omwe owaayehangire kubaza omu kaso; kureka MUKAMA akabahayo boona omu mikono yaabo. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:14">Yos 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:56">1 Bag 8:56</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:35">Mat 24:35</ref>. </char></note> Omu bigambo byona ebirungi ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire ab'enju y'Abaisraeli, tihariho na kimwe ekyabuzire; byona bikaba kwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Enganda ibiri n'ekicweka okugaruka owaazo seeri ya Yorudani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Bwanyima Yoshua yaayeta Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:20">Kub 32:20</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Mukozire byona ebi Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabaragiire; kandi omuri byona ebi naabaragiire, mukanyorobera. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Ebiro ebi ebingi ebi mumazire, timukahemukaga ahari beene waanyu n'okuhitsya hati, kureka mworobeire ekiragiro eki MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaragiire. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Kub 32:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:8">Bir 29:8</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ahuumwize beene waanyu, nk'oku yaabaraganiise; n'ahabw'ekyo mugarukyeyo, muze omu maka gaanyu omu nsi y'obutaka bwanyu ei Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabahaire seeri ya Yorudani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:22">Bir 11:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:36">Mat 22:36</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 22:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:5">1 Tim 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:9">Yoh 15:9</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:3">1 Yoh 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka muteho omutima munonga kworobera ebiragiro byona ebi Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaabaragiire, okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, okugyendera omu mihanda ye yoona, okworobera ebiragiro bye, okumuhamiraho, n'okumuheereza n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona. <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 39:43">Kur 39:43</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yoshua yaabashabira omugisha, yaaboohereza, baagaruka omu maka gaabo.<verse eid="JOS 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Ekicweka kimwe eky'oruganda rwa Manaase Musa akaba yaabahaire obuhunguzi omuri Bashani; kwonka ekindi kicweka kyarwo Yoshua niwe yaabahaire obuhunguzi omuri beene waabo seenu ya Yorudani oburengyerwa-izooba. Kandi Yoshua, ku yaaboohereize kugaruka omu maka gaabo, yaabashabira omugisha, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:24">1 Sam 30:24</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Mugarukye omu maka gaanyu, mutware ebintu bingi, n'amatungo maingi munonga, efeeza, ezaabu, emiringa, ebyoma, n'ebijwaro bingi munonga; mubagane na beene waanyu eminyago y'abazigu baanyu.<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enganda ibiri n'ekicweka okukora eitambiro ahari Yorudani; n'abandi okuzigwerwa kubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase baagarukayo, baataana n'Abaisraeli okuruga Shiilo ey'omu nsi ya Kanaani, kuza omu nsi ya Gileadi ei baayekubuuriire, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaagambiire Musa oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="JOS 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Ku baahikire omu kyanga ekiri haihi na Yorudani omu nsi ya Kanaani, Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase baakora eitambiro haihi na Yorudani, eitambiro rihango munonga. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:8">Lev 17:8</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baahurira abarikugira bati: Reeba Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase bakozire eitambiro aha mwatano gw'ensi ya Kanaani, haihi na Yorudani, aha rubaju rw'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:1">Bar 20:1</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli ku baakihuriire, omutwe gwona gw'Abaisraeli gwayeteeranira Shiilo kuza kubarwanisa. <verse eid="JOS 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:14">Bir 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 20:12">Bar 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:7">Kub 25:7</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baatuma Finehaasi mwene Eleazaari omunyamurwa aha Bareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase omu nsi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Baamutuma n'abakuru ikumi, buri ruganda rwa Israeli omukuru omwe ow'omuryango gwa baishenkurubo, buri omwe omuribo akaba ari omukuru w'omuryango gwa baishenkurubo omu nganda za Israeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Baija omu nsi ya Gileadi, baashangayo Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, baagamba nabo nibagira bati: <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:12">Bir 13:12</ref>. </char></note> Ab'eihanga ryona erya MUKAMA baatutuma ngu: Eki kicumuro ki mucumwire ahari Ruhanga wa Israeli mukikoreire ki, okureka kukuratira MUKAMA, mukeekorera eitambiro, mukamugomera? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:3">Kub 25:3</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:3">Bir 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu ekicumuro eki twacumuriire omuri Peori kikatubeera kikye? Timurikumanya na hati ku tutakakyetuuraga, n'obu orufu rwateire eihanga rya MUKAMA? <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Kub 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:1">1 Bus 21:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 21:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ekyo kikaabareeteire okuteishuka, mukareka kukuratira MUKAMA eri izooba? Ekiraabirugyemu ahabw'okugomera MUKAMA eri izooba, nyencakare naija kugirira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:8">Lev 17:8</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yos 18:1</ref>. </char></note> Ensi yaanyu ei mwakubwire ku eraabe esiisikaire, mwambukye mwije omu nsi ya MUKAMA, ei eihema rya MUKAMA riri, mutungye obutaka omuriitwe; kwonka mutagomera MUKAMA, kandi naitwe mutatugomera, mukeekorera erindi itambiro, eritari rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Yos 7:1</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 7:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya Akani mwene Zeera ku yaacumwire akatwara aha byabiikiirwe MUKAMA, eihanga ryona erya Israeli rikahikwaho ekiniga kingi? Kandi ogwo mushaija taracwekyereire wenka ahabw'ekicumuro kye.<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kw'enganda ezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase baagarukamu nibagambira abakuru b'enganda za Israeli bati: <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:47">Dan 2:47</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:39">1 Bag 8:39</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:21">Zab 44:21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:13">Heb 4:13</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga Nyamuhanga! MUKAMA Ruhanga Nyamuhanga niwe arikukimanya, kandi n'Abaisraeli baryakimanya. Ku turaabe twakikozire ahabw'obugomi nari ahabw'okucumura ahari MUKAMA, eri izooba tutakira! <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:3">Zab 7:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 7:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Ku turaabe twayekoreire eitambiro ngu tuteishukye, turekye kukuratira MUKAMA, nari ngu tutambireho ebitambo ebyokize, nari empongano z'eby'okurya, nari ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, MUKAMA wenka abe niwe yaabitutura; <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />kureka tukikozire twine eki tukikoreire, ngu omu biro ebiriija abaana baanyu bataribuuza abaitu bati: Mwine kakwate ki na MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Timurikumanya ngu MUKAMA akataho Yorudani kuba omwatano gwaitu naimwe, imwe Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi? Timwine mugabo ahari MUKAMA. N'ahabw'ekyo abaana baanyu baryazibira abaitu kutiina MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Nikyo kyatureeteire kugira tuti: Ka twekorere eitambiro, eritari ry'okutambiraho ebitambo ebyokize nari ebindi bitambo; <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:48">Kut 31:48</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:27">Yos 24:27</ref>. </char></note> kureka ribe eky'okuhamya ahagati yaitu naimwe, na baijukuru baitu abaritukurata, ku turi abantu abakora omurimo gwa MUKAMA nitutambira ebitambo ebyokize omu maisho ge n'ebindi bitambo n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, abaana baanyu nyentsya batarigira abaitu omu biro ebiriija bati: Timwine mugabo ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Nikyo twagiriire tuti: Ku baritugira batyo, nari baagira kwo baijukuru baitu omu biro ebiriija, itwe turyabagarukamu tuti: Reeba eitambiro eri tukozire, eririkushushana n'eitambiro eri baatatenkuriitwe baakozire, eritari ry'ebitambo ebyokize nari ebindi bitambo, kureka ery'okuhamya ahagati yaitu naimwe. <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:13">Bir 12:13</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Nikikabure itwe okugomera MUKAMA eri izooba, tukateishuka, tukareka kumukuratira, tukeekorera eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo, nari ery'okuhongyeraho empongano z'eby'okurya, nari ebindi bitambo, ritari itambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu eriri omu maisho g'eihema rye.<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezo nganda okugarukana n'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Finehaasi omunyamurwa n'abakuru b'eihanga, nibo bakuru b'emiryango y'Abaisraeli abu yaabaire aine, ku baahuriire ebigambo by'Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'Abamanaase, baashemererwa munonga. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:25">1 Kor 14:25</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Finehaasi mwene Eleazaari omunyamurwa yaagambira Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'Abamanaase ati: Mbwenu eri izooba nibwo twamanya ku MUKAMA ari omuriitwe, ahakuba timurakozire kicumuro eki ahari MUKAMA; mbwenu mwakiza Abaisraeli okutaitwa mukono gwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Bwanyima Finehaasi mwene Eleazaari omunyamurwa n'abakuru baaruga omu nsi ya Gileadi; ei baashangire Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi, baagaruka omu nsi ya Kanaani aha Baisraeli, baabagambira ebyabaireho. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Ekyo kyashemeza Abaisraeli, baahimbisa Ruhanga, tibaagaruka kugamba by'okurwanisa Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi, n'okucwekyereza ensi ei batwiremu. <verse eid="JOS 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:27">Yos 24:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eryo itambiro Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi baaryeta Edi; amakuru gaakyo, ngu eky'okuhamya ahagati yaitu naimwe ku MUKAMA ari Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okwehanangiriza eihanga ryona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Bwanyima y'ebiro bingi MUKAMA aherize kuha Abaisraeli okuhuumura engamba z'abazigu baabo boona abaabaire babeehinguririize, na Yoshua yaakuzire, yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru, <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:28">Bir 31:28</ref>. </char></note> yaayeta Abaisraeli boona, n'abakuru baabo n'abategyeki n'abaramuzi n'abakuru b'engabo, yaabagira ati: Reeba hati nkuzire, mpikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />kandi mukareeba byona ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaakozire amahanga aga goona ahabwanyu; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe yaabarwaniriire. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Reeba, mperize kubabaganisiza amahanga aga agakitsigaireho kuba obuhunguzi bw'enganda zaanyu, hamwe n'amahanga goona agu naahwerekyereize okuruga Yorudani okuhika aha Nyanja empango aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:23">Bir 11:23</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe aribabinga omu maisho gaanyu, akabatuntumura, mukabona kukubuura ensi yaabo nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaraganiise. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:7">Yos 1:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo muhamire kimwe mubone kwerinda n'okukora byona ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Musa, murekye kuteishuka mukabirugamu kutoora orubaju-rwa-buryo nari orwa-bumosho, <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:14">Enf 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:11">Efe 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:13">Kur 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:7">Yer 5:7</ref>. </char></note> mutariteerana n'amahanga aga agatsigaire omuriimwe; mutarigamba aha maziina ga baaruhanga baabo, nari okubarahira nari okubakorera, n'obu kwakuba okubaramya, <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:20">Bir 10:20</ref>. </char></note> kureka muhamire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku mwakozire n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Nimumanya ku MUKAMA yaabingire amahanga makuru kandi ag'amaani omu maisho gaanyu; kwonka imwe tihaine muntu weena orabagiire omu kaso n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 15:15">Bar 15:15</ref>. </char></note> Omwe omuriimwe aryabinga rukumi; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe aribarwanirira, nk'oku yaabagambiire. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo muteho omutima munonga kukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:38">Heb 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:20">2 Pet 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku murigaruka enyima omu muringo gwona, mwateerana n'amahanga aga agatsigaire omuriimwe, mwashwererana nago, kandi mwataahirana nago, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:3">Bar 2:3</ref>. </char></note> mumanyire kimwe mutarikubanganisa ku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu atarigaruka kubinga amahanga ago omu maisho gaanyu, kureka baryababeera obusya n'omutego, babe eky'okubaasha omu mbaju, n'amahwa omu maisho gaanyu, okuhitsya obu murihwerekyererera omu nsi egi enungi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabahaire, mukahwaho.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 12:3-7">Mub 12:3-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:33">Luk 21:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi reeba, eri izooba naaza kugyenda, nk'oku ab'ensi boona bagyenda; kandi mwena nimumanya gye omu mitima yaanyu n'omu magara gaanyu, ku hatariho kintu na kimwe ekirabuzire aha birungi byona ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaraganiise; byona bikabahikaho, tihariho kintu na kimwe ekitarabaireho. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:63">Bir 28:63</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:22">Luk 21:22</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku mwatungire ebirungi byona ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabagambiire, nikwo MUKAMA aribareetaho ebibi byona, okuhitsya obu aribahwerekyerereza omu nsi egi enungi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabahaire, akabamaraho. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Ku muricumura, mwaita endagaano ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabahaire, mwagyenda, mwaheereza baaruhanga abandi, mwabaramya, MUKAMA aryabagirira ekiniga kingi, muhwerekyererere juba omu nsi enungi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabahaire, muhweho.<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okuragaana n'eihanga ryona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 18:25">Kur 18:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yoshua yaateeranira Shekemu enganda za Israeli zoona, yaayeta abakuru b'Abaisraeli n'abategyeki n'abaramuzi n'abakuru b'engabo; baija kweyoreka omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yoshua yaagambira abantu boona ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Obunyakare baashwenkuriimwe bakaba batwire seeri y'omugyera Furaati, nangwa na Teera, ishe wa Abrahamu na Nahori; bakaba baheereza baaruhanga abandi. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Bwanyima naiha Abrahamu shwenkuriimwe seeri y'ogwo mugyera, naamurabya omu nsi yoona eya Kanaani, naakanyisa oruzaaro rwe, naamuha Isaaka. <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:5">Bir 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Isaaka naamuha Yakobo na Esau; Esau naamuha ensi y'ebibungo ya Seiri kuba eye; kwonka Yakobo n'oruzaaro rwe baashuuma omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:10">Kur 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:1-12:36">7:1—12:36</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naatuma Musa na Arooni, naateeza Misri ebibonaboneso ebi naagireetsiremu; bwanyima yaabyo naabaihayo. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kur 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:4">Mik 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:9">Kur 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:13">Zab 78:13</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:29">Heb 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Naiha baashwenkuriimwe Misri; naabahitsya aha Nyanja erikutukura; Abanyamisri baabakurata n'ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi okuhika aha nyanja egyo. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Ku baatakiire MUKAMA, yaata omwirima ahagati yaanyu n'aba Misri, yaagarura amaizi g'enyanja, gaabashweka; kandi n'amaisho gaanyu gakeerebera ebi naakozire omuri Misri; bwanyima mwamara ebiro bingi omu ihamba. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21">Kub 21:21</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Naabatwara omu nsi y'Abaamori, abaabaire batwire aha rundi rubaju rwa Yorudani; baabarwanisa, naabahayo omu mikono yaanyu, mwakubuura ensi yaabo, naabahwerekyerereza omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Kub 22:5</ref>. </char></note> Na Balaki mwene Zipori omugabe wa Moabu yaimuka, yaarwanisa Abaisraeli yaatuma ahari Balamu mwene Beori, kwija kubakyeena; <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:5">Bir 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 23:11">Kub 23:11</ref>. </char></note> kwonka naayanga kuhurira Balamu; n'ahabw'ekyo Balamu yaabashabira omugisha; okwo nikwo naabakirize omu mikono ya Balaki.<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Bwanyima mwayambuka Yorudani, mwahika Yeriko; abaayo baabarwanisa, nangwa n'Abaamori n'Abaperizi n'Abanyakanaani n'Abahiiti n'Abagirugashi n'Abahiivi n'Abayebusi; naabahayo omu mikono yaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:28">Kur 23:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:3">Zab 44:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 44:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naayohereza enwa kubeebembera, zaababinga omu maisho gaanyu, nangwa n'abagabe babiri b'Abaamori, tibarabingirwe zaarurara zaanyu n'amata gaanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10">Bir 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Naabaha ensi ei mutarahendekyeire, n'endembo ezi mutarombekire, mwazituuramu; kandi na hati nimurya aha mizaabibu n'emizeituuni ei mutarabyaire.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:12">Bir 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:31">Byak 9:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:12">2 Kor 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:7">Ezk 20:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati mutiine MUKAMA, mumuheereze omu mazima mutarikuryarya; kandi mwihireho kimwe baaruhanga abu baashwenkuriimwe baabaire nibaheerereza seeri y'omugyera Furaati n'omuri Misri; muheereze MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:7">Bir 13:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku muraabe nimugira ngu ni kibi okuheereza MUKAMA, eri izooba mutoorane ou muraaheereze, yaaba baaruhanga abu baashwenkuriimwe baabaire nibaheereza seeri y'omugyera, nari baaruhanga b'Abaamori abu mutwire omu nsi yaabo; kwonka nyowe n'eka yangye nitwija kuguma nituheereza MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Abantu baagarukamu nibagira bati: Nikikabure itwe okwimuura MUKAMA, tukeehongyera baaruhanga abandi; <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu niwe yaatwihire omuri Misri na baatatenkuriitwe omu nju y'obuhuuku, akakora eby'okureeberaho ebyo ebikuru, kandi akaturinda omu muhanda gwona n'omu bantu boona, ei twarabire. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Kandi MUKAMA akabinga amahanga goona omu maisho gaitu, Abaamori abaabaire batwire omu nsi egyo; nikyo naitwe turigumira nituheereza MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba niwe Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:25-33">Luk 14:25-33</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 6:20">1 Sam 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:21">Kur 23:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Yoshua yaagambira abantu ati: Timurikubaasa kuheereza MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ni Ruhanga orikwera, kandi Ruhanga ow'eihato; taribasaasira by'okushiisha byanyu n'ebibi byanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:12-15">Yos 23:12-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:26-28">Heb 10:26-28</ref>. </char></note> Ku muriimuura MUKAMA, mwayehongyera baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga, aryabahindukana, abakore kubi, abamareho, bwanyima y'okubakora gye. <verse eid="JOS 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Abantu baagarukamu Yoshua bati: Ngaaha! Kureka itwe turyaguma nituheereza MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Yoshua yaabagira ati: Muri baakareebi abarikwehamiza ku mutooraine MUKAMA kuba niwe mwaheereza. Baagarukamu bati: Turi baakareebi. <verse eid="JOS 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:2">Kut 35:2</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:3">1 Sam 7:3</ref>. </char></note> Yoshua yaagira ati: Mbwenu nu nimwiheho baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga abari omuriimwe, mute emitima yaanyu ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="JOS 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Abantu baagambira Yoshua bati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu niwe turiguma nituheereza, kandi n'eiraka rye niryo turihurira. <verse eid="JOS 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:17">2 Bag 11:17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yoshua yaaragaana n'abantu eryo izooba, yaabateeraho ebiragiro n'ebyaragiirwe, bari Shekemu.<verse eid="JOS 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 9:6">Bar 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:18">Kut 28:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yoshua yaahandiika ebigambo ebyo omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga; yaatwara eibaare rihango, yaaribyara ahansi y'omwela, ogwabaire guri haihi n'Omwanya gwa MUKAMA ogurikwera. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:48">Kut 31:48</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:19">Bir 31:19</ref>. </char></note> Yaagambira abantu boona ati: Reeba, eibaare eri riryaguma riri kareebi w'okutushinja, ahakuba ryahurira ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA yaatugambira; n'ahabw'ekyo riryaguma riri kareebi waanyu, ngu mutaryehakana Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Okuruga aho Yoshua yaayohereza abantu, buri muntu okugaruka omu buhunguzi bwe.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Bwanyima y'ebyo Yoshua mwene Nuuni omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaafa, ahikize emyaka igana na ikumi, <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />baamuziika omu kyanga ky'obuhunguzi bwe Timunaati-seera, omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'ekibungo kya Gaashi. <verse eid="JOS 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:7">Bar 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaisraeli bakaheereza MUKAMA omu biro byona ebya Yoshua, n'omu biro byona eby'abakuru abaatsigaireho yaafiire, abaabaire nibamanya ebi MUKAMA yaakoreire Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 50:25">Kut 50:25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kur 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Kut 33:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amagufa ga Yosefu, agu Abaisraeli baihire Misri, baagaziika Shekemu omu kibanja eki Yakobo yaaguzire ahari beene Hamori ishe wa Shekemu ebicweka igana by'efeeza; ekibanja ekyo kyaba obuhunguzi bwa baijukuru ba Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:25">Kur 6:25</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Eleazaari mwene Arooni nawe yaafa; baamuziika aha kabungo aku Finehaasi omutabani yaahairwe omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>